(3631096, 506212, 69487, '<td valign="top">I dont ever do this but BS DQ, prove the camera made a solid color with 0 noise!  Lol good luck this isnt the first time ad last time i saw this they got DQ''d for editing.<br/> <br/>It is against the rules to remove major elements and or distort the image in a way that it would change the voters definition of the title.  That includes bluring it to a solid color.</td>', 'I dont ever do this but BS DQ, prove the camera made a solid color with 0 noise!  Lol good luck this isnt the first time ad last time i saw this they got DQ''d for editing. It is against the rules to remove major elements and or distort the image in a way that it would change the voters definition of the title.  That includes bluring it to a solid color.', '2007-05-09 01:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
