(3631222, 508001, 60174, '<td valign="top">Having just kites against sky isn''t a very engaging image for me.  Choosing an angle where both the kites and the people flying them were in view (such as when the kites are just going up so they''re still near enough to see well) might have been more visually interesting.  Nice color, though, and I like the slight motion blur.</td>', 'Having just kites against sky isn''t a very engaging image for me.  Choosing an angle where both the kites and the people flying them were in view (such as when the kites are just going up so they''re still near enough to see well) might have been more visually interesting.  Nice color, though, and I like the slight motion blur.', '2007-05-09 01:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
