(3631305, 507061, 60174, '<td valign="top">Interestig effect... took me a minute to figure out how you achieved it. It actually kind of makes me go cross-eyed, but it''s creative and different.  I can''t decide if I like it or not, but I''ve paused on this photo longer than on any other I''ve scored so far, and that has to be a good thing.</td>', 'Interestig effect... took me a minute to figure out how you achieved it. It actually kind of makes me go cross-eyed, but it''s creative and different.  I can''t decide if I like it or not, but I''ve paused on this photo longer than on any other I''ve scored so far, and that has to be a good thing.', '2007-05-09 01:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
