(3632088, 507374, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, but there is some posterization artifacts probably from an aggressive use of the shadow/highlight filter.  When your subject is in a very bright environment like white water or snow or a beach, your camera will expose for the highlights, so you have to dial in at least a +1 or +1.5EV exposure compensation to expose the shot correctly.</td>', 'Great action shot, but there is some posterization artifacts probably from an aggressive use of the shadow/highlight filter.  When your subject is in a very bright environment like white water or snow or a beach, your camera will expose for the highlights, so you have to dial in at least a +1 or +1.5EV exposure compensation to expose the shot correctly.', '2007-05-09 08:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
