(3632494, 507938, 34481, '<td valign="top">It would help this image greatly if you leveled the horizontal lines and if the main subject was not placed so centrally. Good luck.</td>', 'It would help this image greatly if you leveled the horizontal lines and if the main subject was not placed so centrally. Good luck.', '2007-05-09 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632496, 508422, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I would have cropped out the guy in the lab coat though.  My eye sees the lab coat man first, then the man playing cricket.  I think that is because he''s wearing black pants - it jumps out at you faster and foremost.</td>', 'Nice.  I would have cropped out the guy in the lab coat though.  My eye sees the lab coat man first, then the man playing cricket.  I think that is because he''s wearing black pants - it jumps out at you faster and foremost.', '2007-05-09 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
