(3632555, 509084, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Superb freeze of the action and outstanding exposure.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great capture!  Superb freeze of the action and outstanding exposure.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2007-05-09 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
