(3632586, 507841, 77364, '<td valign="top">Too many shadows on the subject - too dark.  But you did capture the essense of the challenge when several people failed to demonstrate action.</td>', 'Too many shadows on the subject - too dark.  But you did capture the essense of the challenge when several people failed to demonstrate action.', '2007-05-09 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632590, 507902, 77364, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  You capstured the essense of this challenge perfectly.  I was doing some research on action shots, and from what I read, baseball is a challenging sport to capture on film in that a lot of it is vertical.  Great photo</td>', 'Very nice!  You capstured the essense of this challenge perfectly.  I was doing some research on action shots, and from what I read, baseball is a challenging sport to capture on film in that a lot of it is vertical.  Great photo', '2007-05-09 11:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632591, 509432, 77364, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  Capturing the subjects face is important in action shots and you did it well.</td>', 'Nice entry.  Capturing the subjects face is important in action shots and you did it well.', '2007-05-09 11:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632595, 509408, 45004, '<td valign="top">Image is dark and has alot of noise. Maybe would like to have been closer to the action as well.</td>', 'Image is dark and has alot of noise. Maybe would like to have been closer to the action as well.', '2007-05-09 11:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632601, 508160, 45004, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the tops of the heads, but like the shot. I am glad it is B&amp;W. It adds to it.</td>', 'I would have liked to see the tops of the heads, but like the shot. I am glad it is B&W. It adds to it.', '2007-05-09 11:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632605, 508950, 77364, '<td valign="top">Getting great shots at professional sporting events is difficult - especially since we all have to sit in the stands.  That being said, this i a nice photo - but the key players are too far away.  I know that the challenge is action, but the theme of this photo says green lawn first, then the people in the stands second and thirdly, the players on the field.  Great try though.</td>', 'Getting great shots at professional sporting events is difficult - especially since we all have to sit in the stands.  That being said, this i a nice photo - but the key players are too far away.  I know that the challenge is action, but the theme of this photo says green lawn first, then the people in the stands second and thirdly, the players on the field.  Great try though.', '2007-05-09 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632610, 509025, 45004, '<td valign="top">I like the focus a lot.</td>', 'I like the focus a lot.', '2007-05-09 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632615, 509482, 77364, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph!  I love the action in it and the bulging muscles! :-)  The position of the sun is great and I love the color of the rock</td>', 'Awesome photograph!  I love the action in it and the bulging muscles! :-)  The position of the sun is great and I love the color of the rock', '2007-05-09 11:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632630, 508539, 45004, '<td valign="top">Would have liked the ball to have more focus.</td>', 'Would have liked the ball to have more focus.', '2007-05-09 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632639, 509413, 45004, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but to far from the action to tell what is going on. With out the title I would not know.</td>', 'Nice sky, but to far from the action to tell what is going on. With out the title I would not know.', '2007-05-09 11:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632641, 509517, 77364, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I tried capturing fishing as the theme of my entry in this challenge - but my photo shoot failed miserably and I ended up using a golf shot.  I love the fish''s eye - he looks terrified.  I am an ametuer so I really do not know how to correct what I see, but I think the photo is a bit dark.  You really have to look at to see the fish.</td>', 'Great idea.  I tried capturing fishing as the theme of my entry in this challenge - but my photo shoot failed miserably and I ended up using a golf shot.  I love the fish''s eye - he looks terrified.  I am an ametuer so I really do not know how to correct what I see, but I think the photo is a bit dark.  You really have to look at to see the fish.', '2007-05-09 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3632648, 509411, 45004, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of feild.</td>', 'I like the depth of feild.', '2007-05-09 11:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
