(3633327, 508644, 71121, '<td valign="top">The horizon is not really straight, is it?</td>', 'The horizon is not really straight, is it?', '2007-05-09 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633328, 508880, 66709, '<td valign="top">the fans faces made this shot.  I am glad you leave them in.  10</td>', 'the fans faces made this shot.  I am glad you leave them in.  10', '2007-05-09 13:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633331, 508211, 66709, '<td valign="top">this shot should be in the top 10 but sadly it won''t  10</td>', 'this shot should be in the top 10 but sadly it won''t  10', '2007-05-09 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633332, 507551, 71121, '<td valign="top">A shallower DoF would have been nice.</td>', 'A shallower DoF would have been nice.', '2007-05-09 13:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633333, 506837, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stopped motion. Good height of capture. Wonderful expression. Brilliant colors and clarity. A winner in my book.</td>', 'Wonderful stopped motion. Good height of capture. Wonderful expression. Brilliant colors and clarity. A winner in my book.', '2007-05-09 13:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633337, 509417, 77316, '<td valign="top">Great action and interesting lighting.  However, there are some compositional problems with this picture.  The background is very busy and distracting.  The guys feet are cut off and the football gets lost in the telephone pole.</td>', 'Great action and interesting lighting.  However, there are some compositional problems with this picture.  The background is very busy and distracting.  The guys feet are cut off and the football gets lost in the telephone pole.', '2007-05-09 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633339, 508160, 71121, '<td valign="top">My eyes want to see what''s above! (I even tried scrolling before realizing that the picture ended there).</td>', 'My eyes want to see what''s above! (I even tried scrolling before realizing that the picture ended there).', '2007-05-09 13:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633350, 509171, 71121, '<td valign="top">I think this one would have been better with focus on the foreground runner (and shallower DoF).</td>', 'I think this one would have been better with focus on the foreground runner (and shallower DoF).', '2007-05-09 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633360, 508966, 71121, '<td valign="top">Great action! My eyes want to look at the jockey, but the horse is sharper...</td>', 'Great action! My eyes want to look at the jockey, but the horse is sharper...', '2007-05-09 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633375, 509273, 71121, '<td valign="top">I would use a longer shutter, follow animals, take lots of pics and hope for the best. Could have made a great shot with the forest all green just blurring together for a great sense of speed and separation between animal and background.</td>', 'I would use a longer shutter, follow animals, take lots of pics and hope for the best. Could have made a great shot with the forest all green just blurring together for a great sense of speed and separation between animal and background.', '2007-05-09 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633380, 509084, 73414, '<td valign="top">whoa.</td>', 'whoa.', '2007-05-09 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633383, 506212, 73414, '<td valign="top">huh?</td>', 'huh?', '2007-05-09 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633387, 508708, 73414, '<td valign="top">niiiccceee.</td>', 'niiiccceee.', '2007-05-09 13:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633389, 507696, 73414, '<td valign="top">perfect form!</td>', 'perfect form!', '2007-05-09 13:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633390, 509111, 71121, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of focusing on the background (i.e. keep the camera still). For a nice "contrast in stress" it would have been really cool to find a background that was solidly relaxed, eternal etc. Like some green fields with a really old church or an old oak, or an old cafe with grandpa''s playing chess.</td>', 'I like the idea of focusing on the background (i.e. keep the camera still). For a nice "contrast in stress" it would have been really cool to find a background that was solidly relaxed, eternal etc. Like some green fields with a really old church or an old oak, or an old cafe with grandpa''s playing chess.', '2007-05-09 13:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633395, 509175, 71121, '<td valign="top">But where is the tequila? :)</td>', 'But where is the tequila? :)', '2007-05-09 13:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633402, 506426, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the fact that you left so much room in front of the swimmer, makes for a great composition.  It makes the viewer feel like part of the photo.  Great capture. 9</td>', 'I love the fact that you left so much room in front of the swimmer, makes for a great composition.  It makes the viewer feel like part of the photo.  Great capture. 9', '2007-05-09 13:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633405, 509107, 73414, '<td valign="top">I think you should have rotated it 90 more degrees...but it''s soo cute!</td>', 'I think you should have rotated it 90 more degrees...but it''s soo cute!', '2007-05-09 13:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633408, 508077, 73414, '<td valign="top">poor thing....what happened?</td>', 'poor thing....what happened?', '2007-05-09 13:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633416, 508920, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very intense boy there!  Great capture.  This breaks some rules I suppose like not being able to see his eyes, and their isn''t much since of motion, but I really like it.  8</td>', 'Very intense boy there!  Great capture.  This breaks some rules I suppose like not being able to see his eyes, and their isn''t much since of motion, but I really like it.  8', '2007-05-09 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633418, 508422, 71121, '<td valign="top">I wish I knew more about cricket.. Whats the "doc" behind him doing? :)</td>', 'I wish I knew more about cricket.. Whats the "doc" behind him doing? :)', '2007-05-09 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633443, 507822, 68256, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition here.  That boy is so expressive and you captured it perfectly. Lighting is also excellent. I hope you don''t get voted down because there is no action or because the little guy isn''t actively participating in a sport.  10</td>', 'I really like your composition here.  That boy is so expressive and you captured it perfectly. Lighting is also excellent. I hope you don''t get voted down because there is no action or because the little guy isn''t actively participating in a sport.  10', '2007-05-09 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633447, 508063, 71121, '<td valign="top">I would perhaps have been possible to get more contrast on his head by desaturating to BW in a different way.</td>', 'I would perhaps have been possible to get more contrast on his head by desaturating to BW in a different way.', '2007-05-09 13:57:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3633455, 508682, 71121, '<td valign="top">Very nice! What a nice PR shot for this "NOUVEL" - whatever it is.<br/>Bokeh looks strange - did you use a reflective "lens"?</td>', 'Very nice! What a nice PR shot for this "NOUVEL" - whatever it is.Bokeh looks strange - did you use a reflective "lens"?', '2007-05-09 14:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633456, 508208, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great b/w.  I love the natural vigneting and composition.  Very mysterious in one way, but to the point in another way. This is so much more interesting than the typically on the water shot.  Thanks.  10</td>', 'Great b/w.  I love the natural vigneting and composition.  Very mysterious in one way, but to the point in another way. This is so much more interesting than the typically on the water shot.  Thanks.  10', '2007-05-09 14:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633463, 509438, 71121, '<td valign="top">Nice action, and he look fierce man!</td>', 'Nice action, and he look fierce man!', '2007-05-09 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633471, 507159, 71121, '<td valign="top">Too bad his feet got clipped :( And a tad longer shutter (+ following with camera to keep bike and biker in focus) would have worked wonders, bringing some action into the shot.</td>', 'Too bad his feet got clipped :( And a tad longer shutter (+ following with camera to keep bike and biker in focus) would have worked wonders, bringing some action into the shot.', '2007-05-09 14:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633474, 508401, 66952, '<td valign="top">How fun! Gotta love a harlequin Dane doing agility!</td>', 'How fun! Gotta love a harlequin Dane doing agility!', '2007-05-09 14:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633479, 508704, 64929, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this much better if the guy in the background wasn''t "attached" to the shoulder of the subject.  Still a great shot *7*</td>', 'Would have liked this much better if the guy in the background wasn''t "attached" to the shoulder of the subject.  Still a great shot *7*', '2007-05-09 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633481, 507902, 71121, '<td valign="top">Slower shutter would have been great. Now you don''t know if the guy to the right is sliding in or if his just posing like that.</td>', 'Slower shutter would have been great. Now you don''t know if the guy to the right is sliding in or if his just posing like that.', '2007-05-09 14:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633486, 508622, 66952, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting tight on his face to see the expression. It''s too bad all these sporting events happen during the middle of the day, when the light is worst. It would be nice if there were less shadow on his face, so that we could see his intense expression better. But still, you''ve really captured the moment.</td>', 'Nice job getting tight on his face to see the expression. It''s too bad all these sporting events happen during the middle of the day, when the light is worst. It would be nice if there were less shadow on his face, so that we could see his intense expression better. But still, you''ve really captured the moment.', '2007-05-09 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633489, 509474, 64929, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the fence lines...kinda ruins the moment, IMHO</td>', 'I don''t care for the fence lines...kinda ruins the moment, IMHO', '2007-05-09 14:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633492, 509025, 71121, '<td valign="top">Wow, great focus.</td>', 'Wow, great focus.', '2007-05-09 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633498, 507847, 64929, '<td valign="top">OMG this is gorgeous!!  My top choice for the Blue!  *10*</td>', 'OMG this is gorgeous!!  My top choice for the Blue!  *10*', '2007-05-09 14:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633509, 508708, 71121, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be on the closest jump, right? That would have been so cool if you got the front of your own bike into the lower right of the photo with a title like "Shit, I''m next!"</td>', 'Focus seems to be on the closest jump, right? That would have been so cool if you got the front of your own bike into the lower right of the photo with a title like "Shit, I''m next!"', '2007-05-09 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633526, 509084, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge!  Crisp action shot!  Bravo, super job!  *9*</td>', 'Great take on the challenge!  Crisp action shot!  Bravo, super job!  *9*', '2007-05-09 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633527, 509407, 71121, '<td valign="top">This is a bit like that high key BW photo with the hot babes in bikinis, all dirty and playing rugby... Can''t remember the photographer, but it''s pretty famous, so I guess someone else here knows. I''m sure I didn''t just dream it ;)</td>', 'This is a bit like that high key BW photo with the hot babes in bikinis, all dirty and playing rugby... Can''t remember the photographer, but it''s pretty famous, so I guess someone else here knows. I''m sure I didn''t just dream it ;)', '2007-05-09 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3633552, 509164, 66952, '<td valign="top">Now, *that* is a noisy pic! The guy is still recognizable as human, though, so I can''t give it a 1.</td>', 'Now, *that* is a noisy pic! The guy is still recognizable as human, though, so I can''t give it a 1.', '2007-05-09 14:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
