(3634495, 507756, 36006, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I am not going to go as far as to say DNMC. However, I do think that this is a <b>lazy</b> attempt to shoe horn something into a challenge just because you can.<br/> <br/>I am not convinced that this is sports related. Not going to waste my time on a good critique.</td>', 'Sorry, I am not going to go as far as to say DNMC. However, I do think that this is a lazy attempt to shoe horn something into a challenge just because you can. I am not convinced that this is sports related. Not going to waste my time on a good critique.', '2007-05-09 18:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634499, 509273, 36006, '<td valign="top">First of all, when I think of sports, I think of <b>humans</b>.<br/> <br/>Even if an animal is included, there should be a human. <br/> <br/>Secondly, this comp sucks. I can care less for the rear end of an animal. The far left tail could of been at the very least cleaned up and cropped out. the color is ok, image could be crisper, light is flat, texture ok.<br/> <br/>Don''t give up, just do better.</td>', 'First of all, when I think of sports, I think of humans. Even if an animal is included, there should be a human.  Secondly, this comp sucks. I can care less for the rear end of an animal. The far left tail could of been at the very least cleaned up and cropped out. the color is ok, image could be crisper, light is flat, texture ok. Don''t give up, just do better.', '2007-05-09 18:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634515, 509474, 36006, '<td valign="top">Mom...<br/> <br/>...why do I want to care for your sons backside? the very least you could of done was to have him turn and let me see his big beautiful smile.<br/> <br/>The fence line is distracting as well. The colors are ok, the light is flat, texture is ok, comp sucks, dof good...<br/> <br/>...come on mom, this is your son. Ya want to show him off don''t ya, well, do so next time.<br/> <br/>Don''t give up, just do better.</td>', 'Mom... ...why do I want to care for your sons backside? the very least you could of done was to have him turn and let me see his big beautiful smile. The fence line is distracting as well. The colors are ok, the light is flat, texture is ok, comp sucks, dof good... ...come on mom, this is your son. Ya want to show him off don''t ya, well, do so next time. Don''t give up, just do better.', '2007-05-09 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634528, 509400, 36006, '<td valign="top">Why do you want me to care for this image?<br/> <br/>I am not convinced that it is a sports watch. It is highly pixelated, the color sucks, the lighting sucks, I can barely make anything out of this.<br/> <br/>Don''t give up, just do better.</td>', 'Why do you want me to care for this image? I am not convinced that it is a sports watch. It is highly pixelated, the color sucks, the lighting sucks, I can barely make anything out of this. Don''t give up, just do better.', '2007-05-09 18:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3634539, 508400, 36006, '<td valign="top">Prove to me that pets enjoy sports as we do, and I will give you a life time of 10''s.<br/> <br/>I am not convinced.<br/> <br/>comp ok, color ok, texture ok, blacks a bit deep, whites ok, nice dof, nice use of thirds, crisp<br/> <br/>Don''t give up, just do better.</td>', 'Prove to me that pets enjoy sports as we do, and I will give you a life time of 10''s. I am not convinced. comp ok, color ok, texture ok, blacks a bit deep, whites ok, nice dof, nice use of thirds, crisp Don''t give up, just do better.', '2007-05-09 18:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
