(3634623, 506837, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Great action happening. His face is well lit and you can see the concentration. Slightly untidy background but it is a bit blurred out and the line up of kids waiting is good. Exposure and saturation has brought your colours out nicely. All round this is a great shot.</td>', 'I like this one. Great action happening. His face is well lit and you can see the concentration. Slightly untidy background but it is a bit blurred out and the line up of kids waiting is good. Exposure and saturation has brought your colours out nicely. All round this is a great shot.', '2007-05-09 19:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
