(3634972, 506257, 36006, '<td valign="top">I guess in some other countries, chess is a sport.<br/> <br/>Too me however, a sport needs humans, not just props.<br/> <br/>With that in mind, why should I care for this image? I don''t play chess, so it is confusing, and cluttered.<br/> <br/>Comp could be better, color yuck, too much to look at and figure out, some texture, light flat, blacks too deep, whites not there, overall a boring image</td>', 'I guess in some other countries, chess is a sport. Too me however, a sport needs humans, not just props. With that in mind, why should I care for this image? I don''t play chess, so it is confusing, and cluttered. Comp could be better, color yuck, too much to look at and figure out, some texture, light flat, blacks too deep, whites not there, overall a boring image', '2007-05-09 20:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
