(3635419, 507847, 36006, '<td valign="top">For a sport photograph, this is very artistic. <br/> <br/>There is this guideline for sport photography, and basically you have gone against all the rules.<br/> <br/>However, photographically speaking, this is a great image. And, sometimes, as I have found, being artistic, ignoring rules can be a good thing.<br/> <br/>Comp is good, but I think there is a bit too much negative space above. Silhouette is excellent, light great, texture great, excellent movement, emotional value great, overall I predict top 10.</td>', 'For a sport photograph, this is very artistic.  There is this guideline for sport photography, and basically you have gone against all the rules. However, photographically speaking, this is a great image. And, sometimes, as I have found, being artistic, ignoring rules can be a good thing. Comp is good, but I think there is a bit too much negative space above. Silhouette is excellent, light great, texture great, excellent movement, emotional value great, overall I predict top 10.', '2007-05-09 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
