(3635623, 506759, 39144, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. All I can do is look at it and ask myself, "Where are the wheels on that thing?" I really like the shadow underneath him and the waves in the background.</td>', 'Interesting picture. All I can do is look at it and ask myself, "Where are the wheels on that thing?" I really like the shadow underneath him and the waves in the background.', '2007-05-10 00:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
