(3635639, 509059, 39144, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s about a sport. The colors and lighting are excellent. I just wish there was action in the shot. When I think of a sports shot, I think of something like you would see on the cover or Sports Illustrated or on the front page of the newspaper. The quality of this photo is good, but it doesn''t seem to have that same "wow" factor.</td>', 'Well, it''s about a sport. The colors and lighting are excellent. I just wish there was action in the shot. When I think of a sports shot, I think of something like you would see on the cover or Sports Illustrated or on the front page of the newspaper. The quality of this photo is good, but it doesn''t seem to have that same "wow" factor.', '2007-05-10 00:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635641, 507385, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent swimming photo. The clarity of the photo is excellent. The colors are processed well and the use of a quick shutter speed to capture the moment really makes this shot stand out above the rest.</td>', 'Excellent swimming photo. The clarity of the photo is excellent. The colors are processed well and the use of a quick shutter speed to capture the moment really makes this shot stand out above the rest.', '2007-05-10 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635643, 507696, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot with all of the right elements. The sports side of it is great, and the technicals of photography also are here. The centered composition I think works well for this shot.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot with all of the right elements. The sports side of it is great, and the technicals of photography also are here. The centered composition I think works well for this shot.', '2007-05-10 00:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635646, 509286, 39144, '<td valign="top">By far one of the best shots of the bunch. I''m sure you''ve heard that already though. I really like how well you panned this shot to get the movement of the bike. That had to take some serious practice. The cropping is perfect. It really makes you want to keep looking at the limited details in this photo.</td>', 'By far one of the best shots of the bunch. I''m sure you''ve heard that already though. I really like how well you panned this shot to get the movement of the bike. That had to take some serious practice. The cropping is perfect. It really makes you want to keep looking at the limited details in this photo.', '2007-05-10 00:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635649, 507450, 39144, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a good capture of a fun sport here. I really like the colors and I especially like how the shadows are not harsh at all. I do think this shot would have done better if it were focused in more on just the closer player, either through a longer lens or more limited DOF.</td>', 'You''ve got a good capture of a fun sport here. I really like the colors and I especially like how the shadows are not harsh at all. I do think this shot would have done better if it were focused in more on just the closer player, either through a longer lens or more limited DOF.', '2007-05-10 00:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635656, 509025, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great use of limited DOF on this shot. The focus is right on. The composition is excellent to really make a point. I could totally see this on the front page of a newspaper. The tones seem just a bit off to me. It''s like the curve is leaning more toward the right side of the histrogram, and there is not enough present on the left. Still, with that, this is an excellent shot. Definitely a top 10.</td>', 'Great use of limited DOF on this shot. The focus is right on. The composition is excellent to really make a point. I could totally see this on the front page of a newspaper. The tones seem just a bit off to me. It''s like the curve is leaning more toward the right side of the histrogram, and there is not enough present on the left. Still, with that, this is an excellent shot. Definitely a top 10.', '2007-05-10 00:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635662, 507847, 39144, '<td valign="top">I really like how you set this shot up. The almost complete framing of the individual by the trees and ground. The perfect silhouette against a beautiful sunset. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like how you set this shot up. The almost complete framing of the individual by the trees and ground. The perfect silhouette against a beautiful sunset. Nice work.', '2007-05-10 00:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635666, 509164, 39144, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say about this photo. The framing and composition are excellent. With that said, the noise level is horrible. There is no detail in the picture anywhere. Was this a mistake, on purpose, or a young photographer learning a new camera?</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say about this photo. The framing and composition are excellent. With that said, the noise level is horrible. There is no detail in the picture anywhere. Was this a mistake, on purpose, or a young photographer learning a new camera?', '2007-05-10 00:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635668, 508032, 39144, '<td valign="top">WOW! Such a beautiful picture. I love the colors and the landscape throughout the photo.</td>', 'WOW! Such a beautiful picture. I love the colors and the landscape throughout the photo.', '2007-05-10 00:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635669, 508584, 39144, '<td valign="top">Oops! It looks like he missed the ball! Kids sure are fun to photograph while playing their sports. The composition is good in this shot. There seems to be a lot of noise present in the photo. His detemination is priceless!</td>', 'Oops! It looks like he missed the ball! Kids sure are fun to photograph while playing their sports. The composition is good in this shot. There seems to be a lot of noise present in the photo. His detemination is priceless!', '2007-05-10 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635673, 509482, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great shot and way to frame it too.</td>', 'Great shot and way to frame it too.', '2007-05-10 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635674, 508053, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is such a difficult sport to photograph because the lights are so dim. You did an excellent job of keeping the exposure right to get all the details and still keep the noise down. Nice work.</td>', 'This is such a difficult sport to photograph because the lights are so dim. You did an excellent job of keeping the exposure right to get all the details and still keep the noise down. Nice work.', '2007-05-10 00:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635682, 507805, 39144, '<td valign="top">Ouch. What a drag. This is a cool stop action photo, but I would suggest playing with the camera settins more next time to maybe turn the ISO up and keep the flash off so you don''t have such a distinct look of the typical on-camera flash that so many people use as a crutch these days. Even if the noise was increased, with the mono conversion that usually helps make the picture look more realistic and normal.</td>', 'Ouch. What a drag. This is a cool stop action photo, but I would suggest playing with the camera settins more next time to maybe turn the ISO up and keep the flash off so you don''t have such a distinct look of the typical on-camera flash that so many people use as a crutch these days. Even if the noise was increased, with the mono conversion that usually helps make the picture look more realistic and normal.', '2007-05-10 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635685, 508505, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot with good coloring, but there is just too much action going on here. It drives me crazy.</td>', 'This is a nice shot with good coloring, but there is just too much action going on here. It drives me crazy.', '2007-05-10 01:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635686, 509407, 15407, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t help but laugh, cant wait to read the description of this scene... How did that ''cross-dresser'' get in with the gals?</td>', 'I couldn''t help but laugh, cant wait to read the description of this scene... How did that ''cross-dresser'' get in with the gals?', '2007-05-10 01:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635687, 506947, 39144, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of parents of soccer kids on DPC. This is one of the best shots I have seen so far. Nice way to capture the action.</td>', 'There are a lot of parents of soccer kids on DPC. This is one of the best shots I have seen so far. Nice way to capture the action.', '2007-05-10 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635688, 509417, 39144, '<td valign="top">This shot is way too busy and blurry to really make it stand out.</td>', 'This shot is way too busy and blurry to really make it stand out.', '2007-05-10 01:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635689, 509400, 39144, '<td valign="top">Too much noise. Not really a good subject for a sports challenge.</td>', 'Too much noise. Not really a good subject for a sports challenge.', '2007-05-10 01:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635690, 509518, 39144, '<td valign="top">The negative effect just doesn''t do this shot any justice.</td>', 'The negative effect just doesn''t do this shot any justice.', '2007-05-10 01:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635691, 508107, 15407, '<td valign="top">If you spent more time on the photo and less time on the title it likely would have been more interesting... not good enough for the brownie.</td>', 'If you spent more time on the photo and less time on the title it likely would have been more interesting... not good enough for the brownie.', '2007-05-10 01:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635692, 509475, 39144, '<td valign="top">This has the potential of a good shot, but the blurry subject in front of the person is really annoying. Other than that, the limtied DOF really makes you focus on the guy in the yellow shirt.</td>', 'This has the potential of a good shot, but the blurry subject in front of the person is really annoying. Other than that, the limtied DOF really makes you focus on the guy in the yellow shirt.', '2007-05-10 01:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3635696, 507854, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture - Great exposure and sharpness - Just a shame about the background people which take away from this nice pic.</td>', 'Lovely capture - Great exposure and sharpness - Just a shame about the background people which take away from this nice pic.', '2007-05-10 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
