(3636385, 507715, 62256, '<td valign="top">Choosing the sky was a good choice here, as your silhouette is pretty striking.  Not sure about your distance to the subject, but maybe firing a flash to fill in some detail on the bridge would improve the transition from light to dark.<br/> <br/>But overall, great shot!  Especially for basic editing!</td>', 'Choosing the sky was a good choice here, as your silhouette is pretty striking.  Not sure about your distance to the subject, but maybe firing a flash to fill in some detail on the bridge would improve the transition from light to dark. But overall, great shot!  Especially for basic editing!', '2007-05-10 09:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636391, 507713, 62256, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Really captures an early morning TRI!  I realize why you had to go B&amp;W as well.  Great choice!</td>', 'Great shot!  Really captures an early morning TRI!  I realize why you had to go B&W as well.  Great choice!', '2007-05-10 10:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636408, 509471, 62256, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Tough subject to capture, but you pulled it off.  I hope he''s alright!</td>', 'Great shot!  Tough subject to capture, but you pulled it off.  I hope he''s alright!', '2007-05-10 10:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636415, 509456, 62256, '<td valign="top">Amazing.  Not only is that kid crazy, but you captured such a great moment.  Love the tones of the pavement matching his skin tones.  Great touch.  Great shot.</td>', 'Amazing.  Not only is that kid crazy, but you captured such a great moment.  Love the tones of the pavement matching his skin tones.  Great touch.  Great shot.', '2007-05-10 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636420, 507251, 62256, '<td valign="top">OMG, this shot rocks!  The pose, his facial expressions, the subject....I love it!  Great work!</td>', 'OMG, this shot rocks!  The pose, his facial expressions, the subject....I love it!  Great work!', '2007-05-10 10:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636423, 507297, 62256, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the Fisheye!  Looks like a spread in a skateboard magazine.  Great shot.</td>', 'Nice use of the Fisheye!  Looks like a spread in a skateboard magazine.  Great shot.', '2007-05-10 10:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636438, 509144, 73032, '<td valign="top">good picture, but the grass and mound don''t look right.(colorwise)</td>', 'good picture, but the grass and mound don''t look right.(colorwise)', '2007-05-10 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636439, 507771, 73032, '<td valign="top">Oh Yeah! 10</td>', 'Oh Yeah! 10', '2007-05-10 10:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636443, 509220, 73032, '<td valign="top">I think it would have looked better in color....(?) maybe?</td>', 'I think it would have looked better in color....(?) maybe?', '2007-05-10 10:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636455, 508561, 36006, '<td valign="top">So, I am sure you are going to get comments that are not appreciated.<br/> <br/>Yes, this is sports related, but, these are tools of a sport, and not as the challenge description suggests, "show some action".<br/> <br/>How ever, photographically speaking, this is a well blocked image.<br/> <br/>So here I go...comp great, color great, movement good,blacks a bit deep, whites blown, excellent texture, great dof, over all a fine image, but not a ribbon winner.</td>', 'So, I am sure you are going to get comments that are not appreciated. Yes, this is sports related, but, these are tools of a sport, and not as the challenge description suggests, "show some action". How ever, photographically speaking, this is a well blocked image. So here I go...comp great, color great, movement good,blacks a bit deep, whites blown, excellent texture, great dof, over all a fine image, but not a ribbon winner.', '2007-05-10 10:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636456, 508160, 73032, '<td valign="top">out of balance, otherwise kinda cool.</td>', 'out of balance, otherwise kinda cool.', '2007-05-10 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636459, 509513, 73032, '<td valign="top">lol...cute :)</td>', 'lol...cute :)', '2007-05-10 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636470, 508708, 73032, '<td valign="top">He''s hard to find.</td>', 'He''s hard to find.', '2007-05-10 10:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636475, 508644, 73032, '<td valign="top">very nice picture</td>', 'very nice picture', '2007-05-10 10:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636479, 508211, 36006, '<td valign="top">Yes, running can be considered a sport, but during competition. <br/> <br/>I am not convinced that this is a competitive situation. I simply looks like three happy kids running down the beach, at sunset.<br/> <br/>However, photographically speaking, this is a good image.<br/> <br/>Comp great, light good but just barely see detail from the faces, nice reflections, great capture with mid air stride, excellent color, excellent lines, nice movement, excellent dof, emotional value good. Overall a great image, and know DPC you may get a ribbon only because this is a good image, or you may get a lot of DNMC.</td>', 'Yes, running can be considered a sport, but during competition.  I am not convinced that this is a competitive situation. I simply looks like three happy kids running down the beach, at sunset. However, photographically speaking, this is a good image. Comp great, light good but just barely see detail from the faces, nice reflections, great capture with mid air stride, excellent color, excellent lines, nice movement, excellent dof, emotional value good. Overall a great image, and know DPC you may get a ribbon only because this is a good image, or you may get a lot of DNMC.', '2007-05-10 10:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636483, 509520, 73032, '<td valign="top">nice picture, looks like a ad.</td>', 'nice picture, looks like a ad.', '2007-05-10 10:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636496, 508538, 36006, '<td valign="top">Ya know, this could of been a ribbon winner, but...<br/> <br/>comp excellent, light ok, the dof is too shallow for this image. Ususally, in sports, you do want a shallow dof as to focus on the athlete. In this case, I want to see his face. I want the photographer to share this athletes emotions, and this is where you failed. All I am able to care about is his finger tips, and that is only part of the story.<br/> <br/>Blacks a bit deep, whites need help, texture ok. Overall, a nice attempt.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ya know, this could of been a ribbon winner, but... comp excellent, light ok, the dof is too shallow for this image. Ususally, in sports, you do want a shallow dof as to focus on the athlete. In this case, I want to see his face. I want the photographer to share this athletes emotions, and this is where you failed. All I am able to care about is his finger tips, and that is only part of the story. Blacks a bit deep, whites need help, texture ok. Overall, a nice attempt. ', '2007-05-10 10:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636520, 508056, 36006, '<td valign="top">this is a good image, I just wish you had put a polarizer on your lens to bring out the water droplets more, and take out the glare more.<br/> <br/> <br/>Great comp, excellent bg, great capture, light good, blacks a bit deep, whites almost blown out, nice movement, emotional value ok, tonal value needs tweaking, overall a very good attempt.</td>', 'this is a good image, I just wish you had put a polarizer on your lens to bring out the water droplets more, and take out the glare more.  Great comp, excellent bg, great capture, light good, blacks a bit deep, whites almost blown out, nice movement, emotional value ok, tonal value needs tweaking, overall a very good attempt.', '2007-05-10 10:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636544, 506212, 77819, '<td valign="top">Needs more focus on the rider.</td>', 'Needs more focus on the rider.', '2007-05-10 10:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636570, 507713, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very classic style to this photo.  I never thought a bunch of people standing around in swim caps could be so cool.  Excellent job!</td>', 'Very classic style to this photo.  I never thought a bunch of people standing around in swim caps could be so cool.  Excellent job!', '2007-05-10 10:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3636578, 509504, 42100, '<td valign="top">The motion blur and b&amp;w conversion in this are just perfect.  This has a life all its own and makes you feel as though you are a part of the action.  Very nice photograph!</td>', 'The motion blur and b&w conversion in this are just perfect.  This has a life all its own and makes you feel as though you are a part of the action.  Very nice photograph!', '2007-05-10 10:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
