(3637023, 508623, 77958, '<td valign="top">Plus: I like the mood the image portrays<br/>Minus: A bit dark.  Lacks a strong focal element.</td>', 'Plus: I like the mood the image portraysMinus: A bit dark.  Lacks a strong focal element.', '2007-05-10 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3637026, 508107, 78289, '<td valign="top">Just didn''t like it.  The golf ball AND the stick are both blurred and burned out.  Most of the scene is out of focus.  For motion only the golf ball should be blurred and on one side only (left side).  Also, the green highlights are blown.  In PS I wouldv''e used auto color and auto level and gone from there.  I''d retake this shot using a tripod and slower shutter speeds with just about any aperture.</td>', 'Just didn''t like it.  The golf ball AND the stick are both blurred and burned out.  Most of the scene is out of focus.  For motion only the golf ball should be blurred and on one side only (left side).  Also, the green highlights are blown.  In PS I wouldv''e used auto color and auto level and gone from there.  I''d retake this shot using a tripod and slower shutter speeds with just about any aperture.', '2007-05-10 13:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3637027, 508584, 77958, '<td valign="top">Plus: nice composition<br/>Minus: the baseball looks too static - a little blur would imply motion a bit better.</td>', 'Plus: nice compositionMinus: the baseball looks too static - a little blur would imply motion a bit better.', '2007-05-10 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
