(3637952, 509147, 78062, '<td valign="top">Strange. I actually find the kite/sail things distracting from this image. It wouldve been great as a picture of the sea alone, the waves at the front are very dynamic.<br/> <br/>That, or a close up of one of the guys in the sea but i think youd need about a 4000mm lens... maybe you could borrow the Hubble?</td>', 'Strange. I actually find the kite/sail things distracting from this image. It wouldve been great as a picture of the sea alone, the waves at the front are very dynamic. That, or a close up of one of the guys in the sea but i think youd need about a 4000mm lens... maybe you could borrow the Hubble?', '2007-05-10 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
