(3638107, 508414, 36006, '<td valign="top">All right, here is the thing.<br/> <br/>this is an ok image. I just say ok because you have left out part of the story...the ending.<br/> <br/>I know this is baseball. I know he is about to slide. But, slide to what? Second? Third? Home? The dugout? The hot dog stand? His car? What?<br/> <br/>Comp could be tighter, too much negative space on bottom and right of frame, great color, good capture but not a crisp capture, excellent emotional value, excellent dof, story telling poor, over all try again</td>', 'All right, here is the thing. this is an ok image. I just say ok because you have left out part of the story...the ending. I know this is baseball. I know he is about to slide. But, slide to what? Second? Third? Home? The dugout? The hot dog stand? His car? What? Comp could be tighter, too much negative space on bottom and right of frame, great color, good capture but not a crisp capture, excellent emotional value, excellent dof, story telling poor, over all try again', '2007-05-10 20:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3638118, 508388, 36006, '<td valign="top">Who is the home run king? the runner? the batter? the umpire? I am not convinced that there was even a home run? where is the ball? convince me.<br/> <br/>comp could be tighter to help eliminate the bg more, after all, it is about the athlete and not the fans. color excellent, dof ok, emotional value poor, good texture, ok light, over all boring</td>', 'Who is the home run king? the runner? the batter? the umpire? I am not convinced that there was even a home run? where is the ball? convince me. comp could be tighter to help eliminate the bg more, after all, it is about the athlete and not the fans. color excellent, dof ok, emotional value poor, good texture, ok light, over all boring', '2007-05-10 20:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
