(3638584, 507450, 36006, '<td valign="top">Why do you want to show me the back side of this athlete? I can care less to see the back. I want to see emotion. After all, sports is about emotion. <br/> <br/>There is this guideline to sports photography. Advertisements that are in focus, like in this image, detract from the athlete, and the action going on. A shallower dof is needed in other words.<br/> <br/>Also in this guideline, it mentions fence lines, walls, and nets that cut people in half. It looks like your athlete is being decapitated.<br/> <br/>Comp could be tighter, excellent color, excellent capture, great texture, great light from what I can see, emotional value poor, dof poor, overall a fair attempt.</td>', 'Why do you want to show me the back side of this athlete? I can care less to see the back. I want to see emotion. After all, sports is about emotion.  There is this guideline to sports photography. Advertisements that are in focus, like in this image, detract from the athlete, and the action going on. A shallower dof is needed in other words. Also in this guideline, it mentions fence lines, walls, and nets that cut people in half. It looks like your athlete is being decapitated. Comp could be tighter, excellent color, excellent capture, great texture, great light from what I can see, emotional value poor, dof poor, overall a fair attempt.', '2007-05-10 23:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3638585, 508420, 73747, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus and not a very exciting subject.</td>', 'A little out of focus and not a very exciting subject.', '2007-05-10 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3638590, 509466, 73747, '<td valign="top">Pretty good photo!  Pretty bad pollution.</td>', 'Pretty good photo!  Pretty bad pollution.', '2007-05-10 23:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3638591, 507713, 56109, '<td valign="top">wow. great scale and excellent shot.</td>', 'wow. great scale and excellent shot.', '2007-05-10 23:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
