(3638805, 508058, 45524, '<td valign="top">I wish the peak action of the collision had been the main focus instead of the results of it. It also appears that it was shot through a net giving the photo a grid over it. I''m not sure if you could have gotten closer to the net and shot wide open at 2.8 if possible to blur the effect so its not so visible.</td>', 'I wish the peak action of the collision had been the main focus instead of the results of it. It also appears that it was shot through a net giving the photo a grid over it. I''m not sure if you could have gotten closer to the net and shot wide open at 2.8 if possible to blur the effect so its not so visible.', '2007-05-11 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
