(3639308, 507385, 42100, '<td valign="top">The aquamarine color with white from the splashes is a very pleasing combo.  That added to the intensity of the swimmer make for a good photo.  Well done!</td>', 'The aquamarine color with white from the splashes is a very pleasing combo.  That added to the intensity of the swimmer make for a good photo.  Well done!', '2007-05-11 10:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639309, 508966, 42100, '<td valign="top">The motion blur is quite interesting, it''s good how you kept the unblurred portion to  the horses head.  Great color tones as well...nicely done!</td>', 'The motion blur is quite interesting, it''s good how you kept the unblurred portion to  the horses head.  Great color tones as well...nicely done!', '2007-05-11 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639310, 507341, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action photo.  That one guy has some pretty serious vertical leap.  The photo works great in b&amp;w...very nicely done!</td>', 'Nice stop action photo.  That one guy has some pretty serious vertical leap.  The photo works great in b&w...very nicely done!', '2007-05-11 10:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639311, 509025, 42100, '<td valign="top">Obviously he''s not in the lead according to your title, but it does leave you pondering some things.  Where in the race is this?  Is it near the end with no time left to catch up and pass?  Is he not as close as he appears(has a telephoto lens compressed the scene)?  <br/> <br/>The b&amp;w conversion is very good.  Good use of DOF with just the right placement of focus.  Well done!</td>', 'Obviously he''s not in the lead according to your title, but it does leave you pondering some things.  Where in the race is this?  Is it near the end with no time left to catch up and pass?  Is he not as close as he appears(has a telephoto lens compressed the scene)?   The b&w conversion is very good.  Good use of DOF with just the right placement of focus.  Well done!', '2007-05-11 10:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639321, 509058, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice stop action of the horses...it''s pretty cool how almost every single one is in the air.  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice stop action of the horses...it''s pretty cool how almost every single one is in the air.  Well done!', '2007-05-11 10:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639324, 507768, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful sky and the silhouettes are very interesting.  Seems to be an unbalanced amount of dark space at the bottom tough.</td>', 'Very beautiful sky and the silhouettes are very interesting.  Seems to be an unbalanced amount of dark space at the bottom tough.', '2007-05-11 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639327, 509307, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like the artistic tilt in this photo...it''s like he''s taking you along for the ride into his banking turn.  Very nice!</td>', 'I like the artistic tilt in this photo...it''s like he''s taking you along for the ride into his banking turn.  Very nice!', '2007-05-11 10:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639339, 508561, 42100, '<td valign="top">Effective shallow DOF...you''ve really isolated your subjects but still have them the proper identifiable setting.  Maybe...less sky, for less competition with the subjects.</td>', 'Effective shallow DOF...you''ve really isolated your subjects but still have them the proper identifiable setting.  Maybe...less sky, for less competition with the subjects.', '2007-05-11 10:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639348, 509222, 42100, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit on the contrasty side...but I really like this as a b&amp;w and the composition is interesting.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The light is a bit on the contrasty side...but I really like this as a b&w and the composition is interesting.  Nicely done!', '2007-05-11 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
