(3639502, 508388, 24846, '<td valign="top">Is this Kyle Russell? Despite Nebraska having a shut out against Augi I''m sure I''ll be seeing your Longhorns again at the CWS here in Omaha. Hopefully along with my Chreighton Blue Jays. Very much doubt Big Red will make it. Now for the photograph. Like the composition with the leading line of the batter, like the runner coming in as well. Good shutter speed, sharp focus and great color. Good luck on this submission, and bring your camera to Omaha in June. Lots of great shooting at the Blatt.</td>', 'Is this Kyle Russell? Despite Nebraska having a shut out against Augi I''m sure I''ll be seeing your Longhorns again at the CWS here in Omaha. Hopefully along with my Chreighton Blue Jays. Very much doubt Big Red will make it. Now for the photograph. Like the composition with the leading line of the batter, like the runner coming in as well. Good shutter speed, sharp focus and great color. Good luck on this submission, and bring your camera to Omaha in June. Lots of great shooting at the Blatt.', '2007-05-11 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
