(3639532, 509271, 36006, '<td valign="top">Even though the challenge description said to show your best <i><b>\"Action\"</b></i> shot, this is an excellent portraiture.<br/> <br/>Comp well done, dof excellent, lighting out standing, blocking of model excellent, emotional value excellent, if that is make up it truly is convincing, nice touch on the sweat, excellent skin tones, excellent texture, even though the blacks seem a bit deep and mixes with the bg it does not disturb me however more separation should be considered, over all a well thought out portrait, but not a good Action. 7<br/> <br/></td>', 'Even though the challenge description said to show your best \"Action\" shot, this is an excellent portraiture. Comp well done, dof excellent, lighting out standing, blocking of model excellent, emotional value excellent, if that is make up it truly is convincing, nice touch on the sweat, excellent skin tones, excellent texture, even though the blacks seem a bit deep and mixes with the bg it does not disturb me however more separation should be considered, over all a well thought out portrait, but not a good Action. 7 ', '2007-05-11 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639539, 509428, 36006, '<td valign="top">I get it. Runners on base and advancing. <br/> <br/>I have been thinking about this image for a couple of days now. The thing is, it looks like two guys racing each other in opposite directions.<br/> <br/>I am not convinced the runner is advancing to third. Where is second? where is the ball? Hell, if it were not for the helmet on the runner, and the thick pin stripe on the other athlete I wouldn''t even think of them as opposing teams. <br/> <br/>I am looking at only part of the story, longing for more info.<br/> <br/>Comp could be tighter, good capture of motion, light good, excellent emotional value, excellent color, dof could be shallower but not disturbing since bg is static, ok movement, over all could be better.</td>', 'I get it. Runners on base and advancing.  I have been thinking about this image for a couple of days now. The thing is, it looks like two guys racing each other in opposite directions. I am not convinced the runner is advancing to third. Where is second? where is the ball? Hell, if it were not for the helmet on the runner, and the thick pin stripe on the other athlete I wouldn''t even think of them as opposing teams.  I am looking at only part of the story, longing for more info. Comp could be tighter, good capture of motion, light good, excellent emotional value, excellent color, dof could be shallower but not disturbing since bg is static, ok movement, over all could be better.', '2007-05-11 11:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639546, 508058, 36006, '<td valign="top">good capture.<br/> <br/>comp good, lighting good, emotional value excellent, texture excellent, color excellent, movement ok, lines ok, dof excellent, not completely crisp which is a requirement to a good sport image, whites my be blown a bit but not disturbingly, over all an average image.</td>', 'good capture. comp good, lighting good, emotional value excellent, texture excellent, color excellent, movement ok, lines ok, dof excellent, not completely crisp which is a requirement to a good sport image, whites my be blown a bit but not disturbingly, over all an average image.', '2007-05-11 11:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639555, 509025, 43400, '<td valign="top">great capture--good in BW.</td>', 'great capture--good in BW.', '2007-05-11 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639559, 508549, 36006, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used a selective coloration to this image which is against the basic rules set.<br/> <br/>Excellent capture, great com, great emotional value, light flat, good texture of the waves, crip enough, overall a good image.</td>', 'It looks like you used a selective coloration to this image which is against the basic rules set. Excellent capture, great com, great emotional value, light flat, good texture of the waves, crip enough, overall a good image.', '2007-05-11 11:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639563, 509164, 43400, '<td valign="top">Was this intentional?</td>', 'Was this intentional?', '2007-05-11 11:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639565, 507341, 36006, '<td valign="top">good image.<br/> <br/>comp good, emotional value ok, blacks way deep, whites muddy, nice texture, light ok, dof excellent, nice movement, great capture, crisp, overall an average image</td>', 'good image. comp good, emotional value ok, blacks way deep, whites muddy, nice texture, light ok, dof excellent, nice movement, great capture, crisp, overall an average image', '2007-05-11 11:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639586, 508951, 36006, '<td valign="top">There is this guideline to sport photography.<br/> <br/>You have basically qualified this image within the guidelines except for a couple things.<br/> <br/>First, especially when the ball is in play, it needs to be very crisp. The reason is that, as in this image, the ball will distort and detail is lost. The same goes with the athlete. A higher shuuter speed would of solved this issue.<br/> <br/>Secondly, a tighter crop. There is too much negative space on the left. The fence is distracting. If the bg was less dynamic, more static, then the negative space would of worked. It does not in this case.<br/> <br/>And last, your title says "Throw from Third". I see the throw, but where is third? The title does not match the image.<br/> <br/>Comp could be better, color good, whites blown, blacks too deep, texture good, light ok, capture could be better, crisper, emotional value excellent, dof excellent,  movement excellent, overall a great attempt.</td>', 'There is this guideline to sport photography. You have basically qualified this image within the guidelines except for a couple things. First, especially when the ball is in play, it needs to be very crisp. The reason is that, as in this image, the ball will distort and detail is lost. The same goes with the athlete. A higher shuuter speed would of solved this issue. Secondly, a tighter crop. There is too much negative space on the left. The fence is distracting. If the bg was less dynamic, more static, then the negative space would of worked. It does not in this case. And last, your title says "Throw from Third". I see the throw, but where is third? The title does not match the image. Comp could be better, color good, whites blown, blacks too deep, texture good, light ok, capture could be better, crisper, emotional value excellent, dof excellent,  movement excellent, overall a great attempt.', '2007-05-11 12:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639598, 509254, 36006, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s what he''s thinking alright.<br/> <br/>comp could be a bit tighter, too much negative space on left. After all, you want the focus strictly on the athlete and not the bg. Dof excellent, color excellent, fence line cutting through athlete distracting and unwanted, great texture, good light, emotional value excellent, nice movement, over all even though this is not an "ACTION" shot as the description dictates, this is a good image.</td>', 'Yeah, that''s what he''s thinking alright. comp could be a bit tighter, too much negative space on left. After all, you want the focus strictly on the athlete and not the bg. Dof excellent, color excellent, fence line cutting through athlete distracting and unwanted, great texture, good light, emotional value excellent, nice movement, over all even though this is not an "ACTION" shot as the description dictates, this is a good image.', '2007-05-11 12:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639604, 506212, 39679, '<td valign="top">I re-loaded this twice to make sure it wasn''t my browser that was acting strange.  Did you mean to submit this?</td>', 'I re-loaded this twice to make sure it wasn''t my browser that was acting strange.  Did you mean to submit this?', '2007-05-11 12:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639608, 509387, 36006, '<td valign="top">yep, she has an ass, but why should I care?<br/> <br/>I want to see emotion. The thrill of victory, the agony of defeat. I can care less for her back side.<br/> <br/>comp good, texture good, light good, emotional value poor, color excellent, movement ok, overall could be better</td>', 'yep, she has an ass, but why should I care? I want to see emotion. The thrill of victory, the agony of defeat. I can care less for her back side. comp good, texture good, light good, emotional value poor, color excellent, movement ok, overall could be better', '2007-05-11 12:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639620, 507002, 36006, '<td valign="top">OK, here is the thing.<br/> <br/>I want to see the athlete, not the mountain. <br/> <br/>I want to see the emotion of the athlete, not the mountain.<br/> <br/>I want to know if this is a girl or a boy, not limestone or shale.<br/> <br/>Do you see what I am saying? You had an opportunity to get the best angle, and instead gave me a wide shot of a mountain with what I think is a climber.<br/> <br/>Comp could be way tighter, texture nice, light good, color ok, movement ok, overall could be better.</td>', 'OK, here is the thing. I want to see the athlete, not the mountain.  I want to see the emotion of the athlete, not the mountain. I want to know if this is a girl or a boy, not limestone or shale. Do you see what I am saying? You had an opportunity to get the best angle, and instead gave me a wide shot of a mountain with what I think is a climber. Comp could be way tighter, texture nice, light good, color ok, movement ok, overall could be better.', '2007-05-11 12:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639632, 507620, 36006, '<td valign="top">Your title does not match the image.<br/> <br/>How can I tell if these athletes want to actually be in the game? I can not tell by there back side. For all I know you have three kids in uniforms looking out into an empty field. <br/> <br/>I could of received more info if you had at the very least one of these athletes with some emotion on their face. Sports is about emotion, not clean uniforms.<br/> <br/>comp ok, light flat, color excellent, dof good, great texture, emotional value poor, overall a boring image.</td>', 'Your title does not match the image. How can I tell if these athletes want to actually be in the game? I can not tell by there back side. For all I know you have three kids in uniforms looking out into an empty field.  I could of received more info if you had at the very least one of these athletes with some emotion on their face. Sports is about emotion, not clean uniforms. comp ok, light flat, color excellent, dof good, great texture, emotional value poor, overall a boring image.', '2007-05-11 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3639634, 508920, 36006, '<td valign="top">good capture.<br/> <br/>comp good, light ok, color good, great texture, emotional value great, nice movement, overall a great image.</td>', 'good capture. comp good, light ok, color good, great texture, emotional value great, nice movement, overall a great image.', '2007-05-11 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
