(3641006, 508192, 77250, '<td valign="top">I like the very tight-in view and the moment of the climber grabbing for somethin.  The tones and contrast are nice along with the colors, too.  My only advice is that with a close up like this it would be nice to see the climber''s face since its more about the climber rather than the scene.  If you choose a shot that doesn''t include the face then it should be more about the scene.  Does that make sense?</td>', 'I like the very tight-in view and the moment of the climber grabbing for somethin.  The tones and contrast are nice along with the colors, too.  My only advice is that with a close up like this it would be nice to see the climber''s face since its more about the climber rather than the scene.  If you choose a shot that doesn''t include the face then it should be more about the scene.  Does that make sense?', '2007-05-12 00:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
