(3642498, 509058, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness on fast hooves and excellent shooting position. It does look like flying.  There are hardly any hooves touching the ground.</td>', 'Good sharpness on fast hooves and excellent shooting position. It does look like flying.  There are hardly any hooves touching the ground.', '2007-05-12 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
