(3642716, 509286, 18870, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  by far the absolute best of the challenge!!!  I wish I could give it an 11.  you''ll have to settle for a 10.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  by far the absolute best of the challenge!!!  I wish I could give it an 11.  you''ll have to settle for a 10.', '2007-05-12 20:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
