(3642720, 509513, 18870, '<td valign="top">excellent concept, perfectly framed, and super cute.  9.</td>', 'excellent concept, perfectly framed, and super cute.  9.', '2007-05-12 20:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642721, 507847, 18870, '<td valign="top">very nice!  9 from me.</td>', 'very nice!  9 from me.', '2007-05-12 20:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642767, 509456, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the focus, light, lines, and the moment you captured. I can''t decide if seeing his face would improve this or not.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the focus, light, lines, and the moment you captured. I can''t decide if seeing his face would improve this or not.', '2007-05-12 20:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642768, 509307, 24970, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and an interesting angle. Were you in the air as well? Love the composition for some reason; it has a very good feel.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and an interesting angle. Were you in the air as well? Love the composition for some reason; it has a very good feel.', '2007-05-12 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642778, 507251, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great capture of that face! The shallow dof works really well to separate him from the somewhat busy background, and composition is effective.</td>', 'Great capture of that face! The shallow dof works really well to separate him from the somewhat busy background, and composition is effective.', '2007-05-12 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642779, 509254, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture. I especially like the player in the background- what is he doing?  Blues seem oversaturated, even the metal and nets in the background have taken on a blue tint (at least on my monitor).</td>', 'Nice sharp picture. I especially like the player in the background- what is he doing?  Blues seem oversaturated, even the metal and nets in the background have taken on a blue tint (at least on my monitor).', '2007-05-12 20:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642780, 509402, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great subject and setting. I''m curious where the light is coming from, because her legs are sharp and well-lit but her face seems very much in shadow. Also, I have nothing agains centered composition, but I think with this ''pose'' from this angle, a crop that places her to one side might be better suited.</td>', 'Great subject and setting. I''m curious where the light is coming from, because her legs are sharp and well-lit but her face seems very much in shadow. Also, I have nothing agains centered composition, but I think with this ''pose'' from this angle, a crop that places her to one side might be better suited.', '2007-05-12 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642788, 508401, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like that you included the crowd in the background, it gives context to this very nice shot. I''m curious to see how it would look if you moved a bit to the right to include all of the handler(?) in the shot, while still retaining the background of the other obstacles and spectators.</td>', 'I like that you included the crowd in the background, it gives context to this very nice shot. I''m curious to see how it would look if you moved a bit to the right to include all of the handler(?) in the shot, while still retaining the background of the other obstacles and spectators.', '2007-05-12 20:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642789, 506988, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great sense of height with this shot. I love that you captured the flying sand too.</td>', 'Great sense of height with this shot. I love that you captured the flying sand too.', '2007-05-12 20:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642792, 509239, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. I''m not sure I''m a fan of the tree, it might have been good to catch him a bit later, perhaps blocking the bouy with his body, too.</td>', 'Nice lighting. I''m not sure I''m a fan of the tree, it might have been good to catch him a bit later, perhaps blocking the bouy with his body, too.', '2007-05-12 20:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642795, 509475, 24970, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of focus to create a very interesting and unique image. Composition works well; I wish there was a little more light on his face but there''s no way to control that.</td>', 'Excellent use of focus to create a very interesting and unique image. Composition works well; I wish there was a little more light on his face but there''s no way to control that.', '2007-05-12 20:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642797, 509363, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great capture. This also works if your crop out the two people on the right, I think.</td>', 'Great capture. This also works if your crop out the two people on the right, I think.', '2007-05-12 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642801, 508186, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not the most flattering angle I''ve ever seen.  Clearly has the height; hope she cleared the bar.</td>', 'Not the most flattering angle I''ve ever seen.  Clearly has the height; hope she cleared the bar.', '2007-05-12 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642803, 507593, 24970, '<td valign="top">Such an accurate depiction of the games at that age. Maybe this was intentional, but the focus seems to be on #2...I''d also like to see this where the kids'' faces that we can see are in focus instead.</td>', 'Such an accurate depiction of the games at that age. Maybe this was intentional, but the focus seems to be on #2...I''d also like to see this where the kids'' faces that we can see are in focus instead.', '2007-05-12 21:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642805, 509456, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, although it does look a bit like he could be sitting on that projection on the left fro this angle.</td>', 'Nice capture, although it does look a bit like he could be sitting on that projection on the left fro this angle.', '2007-05-12 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642813, 508682, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp capture of the two runners, and those in the background complete it. I''m curious why they''re in such an outside lane, though.</td>', 'Nice sharp capture of the two runners, and those in the background complete it. I''m curious why they''re in such an outside lane, though.', '2007-05-12 21:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642815, 508908, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great isolation of your subject. An unexpected instance of action in sports, and I like it - much less cliche than many (including my own). I''m not sure the border is necessary, but if you like it, great.</td>', 'Great isolation of your subject. An unexpected instance of action in sports, and I like it - much less cliche than many (including my own). I''m not sure the border is necessary, but if you like it, great.', '2007-05-12 21:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642821, 507847, 65234, '<td valign="top">This is really gorgeous in composition and colors, and I love that the line is bowed and the angler leaning back.  I can imagine the fish about to be reeled in.  The leaves on the tree at the top look a little oversharpened on my monitor, but that''s a just a niggle in the grand scheme of things.</td>', 'This is really gorgeous in composition and colors, and I love that the line is bowed and the angler leaning back.  I can imagine the fish about to be reeled in.  The leaves on the tree at the top look a little oversharpened on my monitor, but that''s a just a niggle in the grand scheme of things.', '2007-05-12 21:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642822, 508088, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Colors and detail are very nice, but that lower lip is what makes the shot ;-)</td>', 'Great expression!  Colors and detail are very nice, but that lower lip is what makes the shot ;-)', '2007-05-12 21:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642824, 507891, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ewww!  Great story told here with a single headshot.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Ewww!  Great story told here with a single headshot.  Very nice work.', '2007-05-12 21:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642863, 509422, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture. Too bad the ump is in front of the catcher.</td>', 'Nice action capture. Too bad the ump is in front of the catcher.', '2007-05-12 21:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642869, 508563, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for this use of selective desat. It seems to remove the excitement from the shot. (Maybe there was no excitement -- the stands are empty. :P)</td>', 'Don''t care for this use of selective desat. It seems to remove the excitement from the shot. (Maybe there was no excitement -- the stands are empty. :P)', '2007-05-12 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642870, 509085, 24970, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Wish you could have been a little farther left to avoid the bench(?) in the foreground. Black &amp; white works well for this, I think.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Wish you could have been a little farther left to avoid the bench(?) in the foreground. Black & white works well for this, I think.', '2007-05-12 21:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642872, 508613, 24970, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but I like this shot. There''s a great sense of action and motion, and the composition works very well.</td>', 'A little dark, but I like this shot. There''s a great sense of action and motion, and the composition works very well.', '2007-05-12 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642873, 509164, 24970, '<td valign="top">You''ll have a hard time scoring high with an image like this on this site, but there are a few of us who appreciate and enjoy the abstract, artsy quality of it. Not really a sense of action, so the applicability to the challenge is shaky without the title, but it is otherwise a very interesting shot.</td>', 'You''ll have a hard time scoring high with an image like this on this site, but there are a few of us who appreciate and enjoy the abstract, artsy quality of it. Not really a sense of action, so the applicability to the challenge is shaky without the title, but it is otherwise a very interesting shot.', '2007-05-12 21:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642878, 507397, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of angle. I''d like to see this where the floor instead of ceiling is included, to get a sense of how high he is on the wall. I''m also interested in how it looks in color, my thought is since he''s wearing a solid color he''d stand out enough against the busy background, maybe better than he does now.</td>', 'Interesting choice of angle. I''d like to see this where the floor instead of ceiling is included, to get a sense of how high he is on the wall. I''m also interested in how it looks in color, my thought is since he''s wearing a solid color he''d stand out enough against the busy background, maybe better than he does now.', '2007-05-12 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642883, 507341, 66384, '<td valign="top">Marvelous capture!! The focus is great. Very impressive action. Good focus. And I would like the composition better with the top tier cropped off, but no matter. 10</td>', 'Marvelous capture!! The focus is great. Very impressive action. Good focus. And I would like the composition better with the top tier cropped off, but no matter. 10', '2007-05-12 21:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642885, 508602, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would love to see it from the other side so we could see their faces and the sunlight was working with you.</td>', 'Nice shot. Would love to see it from the other side so we could see their faces and the sunlight was working with you.', '2007-05-12 21:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642889, 507257, 24970, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept with an effective composition. The harsh contrast between the left and right side of his face hurts this for me, you may have been better off shooting from a different angle so it was more evenly lit. And perhaps you''re camera''s not capable of it, but I''d love to see a faster shutter speed on this to really stop the motion, it seems a tiny bit blurred.</td>', 'Excellent concept with an effective composition. The harsh contrast between the left and right side of his face hurts this for me, you may have been better off shooting from a different angle so it was more evenly lit. And perhaps you''re camera''s not capable of it, but I''d love to see a faster shutter speed on this to really stop the motion, it seems a tiny bit blurred.', '2007-05-12 21:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642891, 508462, 38851, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, but not remotely connected to Sports</td>', 'Interesting photo, but not remotely connected to Sports', '2007-05-12 21:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642892, 509111, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice concept which works in some cases but I think there''s too much to look at (esp. words) in the background, which hurts the effect here. Also you might want to include a little more on top so you''re not skimming off the tops of their backs &amp; heads.</td>', 'Nice concept which works in some cases but I think there''s too much to look at (esp. words) in the background, which hurts the effect here. Also you might want to include a little more on top so you''re not skimming off the tops of their backs & heads.', '2007-05-12 21:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642895, 508155, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice timing for the capture. The oversharpening hurts a little.</td>', 'Nice timing for the capture. The oversharpening hurts a little.', '2007-05-12 21:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642896, 507734, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice timing to capture the very beginning of his start, though in my opinion there are more flattering body positions a little bit later when he''s started to move his legs. Aside from that, the dof and sharpness are excellent, and the composition doesn''t detract from your image. Perhaps you could take a little off the bottom, but it works as it.</td>', 'Nice timing to capture the very beginning of his start, though in my opinion there are more flattering body positions a little bit later when he''s started to move his legs. Aside from that, the dof and sharpness are excellent, and the composition doesn''t detract from your image. Perhaps you could take a little off the bottom, but it works as it.', '2007-05-12 21:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642897, 508422, 24970, '<td valign="top">I don''t think anything would be lost from this shot if you cropped off some of the empty space on the left..at least to eliminate the stray shadow. Decent capture of the action, though the picture seems a little washed out.</td>', 'I don''t think anything would be lost from this shot if you cropped off some of the empty space on the left..at least to eliminate the stray shadow. Decent capture of the action, though the picture seems a little washed out.', '2007-05-12 21:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642902, 507841, 24970, '<td valign="top">Did you try shooting from a different angle so you''re not aiming directly into the sun? Good point in the action to capture.</td>', 'Did you try shooting from a different angle so you''re not aiming directly into the sun? Good point in the action to capture.', '2007-05-12 22:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642903, 509088, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wish you could get a slightly higher angle so his head was also silhouetted against the light rather than lost in the ceiling - and if there''s a way to avoid getting a support pole in, that might be good too. Sharp image though, good capture of the stunt. Are the people in the background related, or are they doing their own thing? I like that you included them in any case, it adds interest.</td>', 'Wish you could get a slightly higher angle so his head was also silhouetted against the light rather than lost in the ceiling - and if there''s a way to avoid getting a support pole in, that might be good too. Sharp image though, good capture of the stunt. Are the people in the background related, or are they doing their own thing? I like that you included them in any case, it adds interest.', '2007-05-12 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642904, 506426, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of crop and border. Being that close on top (I''m assuming to cut out the people in the background) may be better balanced by coming in from the bottom as well - possibly at the point where the lane divider comes into focus. Great timing for the capture.</td>', 'Interesting choice of crop and border. Being that close on top (I''m assuming to cut out the people in the background) may be better balanced by coming in from the bottom as well - possibly at the point where the lane divider comes into focus. Great timing for the capture.', '2007-05-12 22:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642906, 509476, 38851, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo, I would have scored higher if it fit in the Challenge category</td>', 'Incredible photo, I would have scored higher if it fit in the Challenge category', '2007-05-12 22:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642908, 509441, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very nice timing and capture of the motion - even the flying bits of sand. This seems slightly oversharpened or something (the trees in the background especially look strange) but other than that is a strong entry. And the rider looks so calm!</td>', 'Very nice timing and capture of the motion - even the flying bits of sand. This seems slightly oversharpened or something (the trees in the background especially look strange) but other than that is a strong entry. And the rider looks so calm!', '2007-05-12 22:01:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3642910, 509318, 24970, '<td valign="top">The contrast may be a little overdone, the clouds on the right look unnaturally blocky. That said, I love the silhouette and the pose you captured. I also like this cropped a little closer, placing your subject closer to the left side of the frame and taking some off the bottom.</td>', 'The contrast may be a little overdone, the clouds on the right look unnaturally blocky. That said, I love the silhouette and the pose you captured. I also like this cropped a little closer, placing your subject closer to the left side of the frame and taking some off the bottom.', '2007-05-12 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642911, 508622, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great timing and clarity, and I like the close crop for this shot. I wish there were more light on his face, it''s very dark, but you can''t control where the sun is. The background color seems unnaturally oversaturated.</td>', 'Great timing and clarity, and I like the close crop for this shot. I wish there were more light on his face, it''s very dark, but you can''t control where the sun is. The background color seems unnaturally oversaturated.', '2007-05-12 22:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642914, 508708, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice setting and colors, but the focus seems to be on the structures in the foreground rather than the biker, who gets a little lost against the trees.</td>', 'Nice setting and colors, but the focus seems to be on the structures in the foreground rather than the biker, who gets a little lost against the trees.', '2007-05-12 22:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642915, 508400, 24970, '<td valign="top">Cute shot. Wish we could see more details in the dog''s face, though I suppose that''s hard with black eyes against black fur. A different angle for the light may help, positioning the shot in various ways in relation to the sun.</td>', 'Cute shot. Wish we could see more details in the dog''s face, though I suppose that''s hard with black eyes against black fur. A different angle for the light may help, positioning the shot in various ways in relation to the sun.', '2007-05-12 22:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642916, 506554, 24970, '<td valign="top">Somehow this action shot looks posed. Nice composition and focus, but it just seems too fake for me (apologies if it''s actually candid).</td>', 'Somehow this action shot looks posed. Nice composition and focus, but it just seems too fake for me (apologies if it''s actually candid).', '2007-05-12 22:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642918, 508652, 24970, '<td valign="top">I like your angle, it allows us to see the complete context of the game. Titled "the pitch", I would expect to see the focus on the pitcher or ball, rather than the three people at home plate. I''m ignoring that in my vote though - I try very hard to score only the picture, not the title. Also, this seems tipped to the right a little bit.</td>', 'I like your angle, it allows us to see the complete context of the game. Titled "the pitch", I would expect to see the focus on the pitcher or ball, rather than the three people at home plate. I''m ignoring that in my vote though - I try very hard to score only the picture, not the title. Also, this seems tipped to the right a little bit.', '2007-05-12 22:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642921, 507702, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp capture, I like that the horses are at such different points of their stride. Somehow it looks like they''re running downhill, which is a little strange.</td>', 'Nice sharp capture, I like that the horses are at such different points of their stride. Somehow it looks like they''re running downhill, which is a little strange.', '2007-05-12 22:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642925, 508498, 24970, '<td valign="top">To me this looks a little oversharpened and oversaturated, but other than that it''s a great capture of the action and composed well.</td>', 'To me this looks a little oversharpened and oversaturated, but other than that it''s a great capture of the action and composed well.', '2007-05-12 22:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642929, 507713, 66384, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe what I''m seeing. 1000 people dressed in black with white swimming caps? And what''s with the right arms raised? Well, I must get on with the voting, can''t stay here all night. 10 for being a real show-stopper!</td>', 'I don''t believe what I''m seeing. 1000 people dressed in black with white swimming caps? And what''s with the right arms raised? Well, I must get on with the voting, can''t stay here all night. 10 for being a real show-stopper!', '2007-05-12 22:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642931, 509271, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very effective shot with nice lighting. Since it''s a studio shot I''m not able to vote it as highly in this challenge as I would normally.</td>', 'Very effective shot with nice lighting. Since it''s a studio shot I''m not able to vote it as highly in this challenge as I would normally.', '2007-05-12 22:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642932, 509164, 66384, '<td valign="top">LOL 8</td>', 'LOL 8', '2007-05-12 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642936, 506669, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and composition (might get rid of the red thing). Something about the lighting, maybe(?) makes the skater and the trees behind him look fake, I can''t put my finger on it but it''s a very strange effect.</td>', 'Nice pose and composition (might get rid of the red thing). Something about the lighting, maybe(?) makes the skater and the trees behind him look fake, I can''t put my finger on it but it''s a very strange effect.', '2007-05-12 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642938, 508063, 24970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would love for his face to be a little better in focus. I know you can''t move the officials, but the head in the background detracts from your clean shot. Also, why black and white?</td>', 'Nice shot. Would love for his face to be a little better in focus. I know you can''t move the officials, but the head in the background detracts from your clean shot. Also, why black and white?', '2007-05-12 22:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642939, 507591, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love the background in this photo - it really captures how chaotic &amp; disorganized children''s sports can be. Oh, and nice shot of the runner too.</td>', 'I love the background in this photo - it really captures how chaotic & disorganized children''s sports can be. Oh, and nice shot of the runner too.', '2007-05-12 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642945, 507715, 24970, '<td valign="top">The "sport" part of this is pretty lost against the beautiful background. Nice shot though.</td>', 'The "sport" part of this is pretty lost against the beautiful background. Nice shot though.', '2007-05-12 22:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642946, 508420, 38851, '<td valign="top">No action, very soft</td>', 'No action, very soft', '2007-05-12 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642947, 507902, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great diagonal composition. I like the shadows on the ground. Perfect capture. (He better get his foot on the base.) 10</td>', 'Great diagonal composition. I like the shadows on the ground. Perfect capture. (He better get his foot on the base.) 10', '2007-05-12 22:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642948, 509220, 24970, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective - he''s practically lost in the wave, giving us a good sense of size. I''m curious to see what this is like in color as well, though perhaps the effect would be lost there.</td>', 'Interesting perspective - he''s practically lost in the wave, giving us a good sense of size. I''m curious to see what this is like in color as well, though perhaps the effect would be lost there.', '2007-05-12 22:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642949, 508704, 24970, '<td valign="top">Something about this picture looks fake - excessive sharpening or contrast, perhaps. Great pose and composition though.</td>', 'Something about this picture looks fake - excessive sharpening or contrast, perhaps. Great pose and composition though.', '2007-05-12 22:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642955, 509417, 24970, '<td valign="top">I give you credit for actually capturing the <i>action</i> of a sport, thank you. Faster shutter speed would obviously help to freeze the motion (though I know many cameras aren''t capable). It looks like there was also a bit of camera shake, which doesn''t help with the blur. Post-processing was a little overdone, perhaps on contrast, so the colors look a bit unnatural. And of course everyone on this site loves impossibly clean backgrounds, so if you could shoot this from an angle with less background clutter that would help.</td>', 'I give you credit for actually capturing the action of a sport, thank you. Faster shutter speed would obviously help to freeze the motion (though I know many cameras aren''t capable). It looks like there was also a bit of camera shake, which doesn''t help with the blur. Post-processing was a little overdone, perhaps on contrast, so the colors look a bit unnatural. And of course everyone on this site loves impossibly clean backgrounds, so if you could shoot this from an angle with less background clutter that would help.', '2007-05-12 22:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642956, 509292, 24970, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure out what''s going on in this picture, the subjects are relatively small in the frame, especially considering there''s nothing spectacular about the background. I think it would help if you were closer and perhaps shooting from a different angle, maybe from slightly behind one of the people. Also, midday lighting is hard to shoot in, you might try the same concept later in the day when the sun is less harsh.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure out what''s going on in this picture, the subjects are relatively small in the frame, especially considering there''s nothing spectacular about the background. I think it would help if you were closer and perhaps shooting from a different angle, maybe from slightly behind one of the people. Also, midday lighting is hard to shoot in, you might try the same concept later in the day when the sun is less harsh.', '2007-05-12 22:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642959, 508191, 24970, '<td valign="top">I love the depth of blues in this shot, and it''s artistically composed. No action though...</td>', 'I love the depth of blues in this shot, and it''s artistically composed. No action though...', '2007-05-12 22:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642962, 509513, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it. 10</td>', 'Love it. 10', '2007-05-12 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642967, 507847, 66384, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous. 10', '2007-05-12 22:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642972, 509273, 24970, '<td valign="top">The random tail on the left is strange, I don''t see why you shouldn''t crop it out. Otherwise, a respectable capture of these animals - not really a traditional sport, we''ll see how it does in this challenge.</td>', 'The random tail on the left is strange, I don''t see why you shouldn''t crop it out. Otherwise, a respectable capture of these animals - not really a traditional sport, we''ll see how it does in this challenge.', '2007-05-12 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642978, 509286, 24970, '<td valign="top">OK, you win. Excellent capture, perfect use of panning to get the subject razor-sharp. Nothing I''d change.</td>', 'OK, you win. Excellent capture, perfect use of panning to get the subject razor-sharp. Nothing I''d change.', '2007-05-12 22:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642979, 508186, 24970, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity and great angle. Would also love to see a wider (taller) perspective on this to get a sense of the height of the vault.</td>', 'Excellent clarity and great angle. Would also love to see a wider (taller) perspective on this to get a sense of the height of the vault.', '2007-05-12 22:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642983, 507803, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice moment!</td>', 'Nice moment!', '2007-05-12 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642985, 509050, 24970, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent capture. I''m sorry I can''t give you any constructive criticism, there''s just nothing I''d want to change about this. One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'Wow. Excellent capture. I''m sorry I can''t give you any constructive criticism, there''s just nothing I''d want to change about this. One of my ribbon picks.', '2007-05-12 22:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642986, 508056, 24970, '<td valign="top">The best surfing picture in the challenge. I like the clarity of your subject, but by far the strongest aspect of this shot is the composition, it works very well.</td>', 'The best surfing picture in the challenge. I like the clarity of your subject, but by far the strongest aspect of this shot is the composition, it works very well.', '2007-05-12 22:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3642996, 509456, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a move! and he looks so young and unprotected. I really like the composition with the subject hanging over that curved line sweeping down to the lower right corner. Perfect focus and DOF, and very pleasing, natural colors. 10</td>', 'Wow, what a move! and he looks so young and unprotected. I really like the composition with the subject hanging over that curved line sweeping down to the lower right corner. Perfect focus and DOF, and very pleasing, natural colors. 10', '2007-05-12 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643031, 506557, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Beautiful lines and colors in the sails. The hard blue of the boat cutting all the way across seems to trap my eye in the bottom of the picture. 8</td>', 'Nice composition. Beautiful lines and colors in the sails. The hard blue of the boat cutting all the way across seems to trap my eye in the bottom of the picture. 8', '2007-05-12 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643055, 509476, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but a little over sharpened. It''s a real shoehorn job for this challenge. And fishing is not sport for the osprey, it''s survival. Maybe I''m wrong, but I think it should have been saved for Free Study.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but a little over sharpened. It''s a real shoehorn job for this challenge. And fishing is not sport for the osprey, it''s survival. Maybe I''m wrong, but I think it should have been saved for Free Study.', '2007-05-12 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643543, 507650, 66515, '<td valign="top">The two children on the right could have been cropped out to make a stronger composition. Of course they also show part of the story as well.</td>', 'The two children on the right could have been cropped out to make a stronger composition. Of course they also show part of the story as well.', '2007-05-13 02:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643550, 507702, 66515, '<td valign="top">This could use some levelling but you captured a great moment here. I like the musculature that was captured in the horses. Its cool that you can even see the one horse''s shoe. The board in the background really adds to the shot too. The motion blur in their legs really gives this a great feeling of action.</td>', 'This could use some levelling but you captured a great moment here. I like the musculature that was captured in the horses. Its cool that you can even see the one horse''s shoe. The board in the background really adds to the shot too. The motion blur in their legs really gives this a great feeling of action.', '2007-05-13 02:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643555, 508584, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but it is terribly noisy. You probably could have used a lot lower ISO to get the shot I think</td>', 'Nice shot but it is terribly noisy. You probably could have used a lot lower ISO to get the shot I think', '2007-05-13 02:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643558, 509476, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hmm...I am going to say that this is DNMC.</td>', 'Hmm...I am going to say that this is DNMC.', '2007-05-13 02:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643560, 507591, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot at least in terms of the subject. The two boys in the background really detract from this picture however.</td>', 'Interesting shot at least in terms of the subject. The two boys in the background really detract from this picture however.', '2007-05-13 02:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643562, 509273, 66515, '<td valign="top">Sorry...DNMC</td>', 'Sorry...DNMC', '2007-05-13 02:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643563, 508539, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice set up but I have to say, Why not take this outside?</td>', 'Nice set up but I have to say, Why not take this outside?', '2007-05-13 02:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643565, 507374, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but its a quite a bit over exposed.</td>', 'Interesting shot but its a quite a bit over exposed.', '2007-05-13 02:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643567, 507938, 66515, '<td valign="top">Definitely could use some levelling. Nice capture of the horse in mid stride though. This could use a bit of a saturation boost to bring out the colors but otherwise this is nice</td>', 'Definitely could use some levelling. Nice capture of the horse in mid stride though. This could use a bit of a saturation boost to bring out the colors but otherwise this is nice', '2007-05-13 02:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643574, 508845, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like this for a lot of different reasons. The composition is bang on with the focus being on the runner''s face. You can see the determination to touch home base. You can see the tension in the catcher''s body as he starts moving to tag the runner. The chain link fence could be a distraction but it visually frames the scene well while adding a common element of the sport into the shot. The exposure is excellent with no obvious blown highlights or underexposed areas. The only way this could be better is if this was shot at Yankee Stadium during game 7 of the World Series. Wow...</td>', 'I really like this for a lot of different reasons. The composition is bang on with the focus being on the runner''s face. You can see the determination to touch home base. You can see the tension in the catcher''s body as he starts moving to tag the runner. The chain link fence could be a distraction but it visually frames the scene well while adding a common element of the sport into the shot. The exposure is excellent with no obvious blown highlights or underexposed areas. The only way this could be better is if this was shot at Yankee Stadium during game 7 of the World Series. Wow...', '2007-05-13 02:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643592, 509498, 39381, '<td valign="top">This had to be a strike. Unless this kid has amazing bat speed :-)</td>', 'This had to be a strike. Unless this kid has amazing bat speed :-)', '2007-05-13 02:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643787, 509456, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice action shot, well captured, nicely balanced, good colours......if the background was just more outta focus (shorter f-stop) it would brilll.........nice one dude!</td>', 'nice action shot, well captured, nicely balanced, good colours......if the background was just more outta focus (shorter f-stop) it would brilll.........nice one dude!', '2007-05-13 08:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643788, 508496, 72103, '<td valign="top">could''ve been a great shot, i just tink the red bulk carrier in the background captures me eye more...sorry 5</td>', 'could''ve been a great shot, i just tink the red bulk carrier in the background captures me eye more...sorry 5', '2007-05-13 08:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643790, 507899, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice balance</td>', 'nice balance', '2007-05-13 08:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643791, 508080, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice title..........(O:</td>', 'nice title..........(O:', '2007-05-13 08:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643792, 509407, 72103, '<td valign="top">.........i''m frightened to ask............!</td>', '.........i''m frightened to ask............!', '2007-05-13 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643793, 506334, 76185, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the scale is just a little off for me. Subject could do with being a little bigger in the frame without losing the impact of the negative space.</td>', 'Great idea, but the scale is just a little off for me. Subject could do with being a little bigger in the frame without losing the impact of the negative space.', '2007-05-13 08:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643796, 507903, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice balance, motorsports shots are always hard with advertising hoards, again my eyes go to it rather than the car, but i love the rubber bounce on the side,,,,,7</td>', 'nice balance, motorsports shots are always hard with advertising hoards, again my eyes go to it rather than the car, but i love the rubber bounce on the side,,,,,7', '2007-05-13 08:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643798, 508538, 72103, '<td valign="top">somehow the action and fear of the moment is missing, i think i''d have focussed on his face and ''blurred'' his hand.  nice balance and works well in B&amp;W -</td>', 'somehow the action and fear of the moment is missing, i think i''d have focussed on his face and ''blurred'' his hand.  nice balance and works well in B&W -', '2007-05-13 08:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643801, 509239, 72103, '<td valign="top">my eyes are drawn to the green buoy and the ship i''m afraid.......without them this would be interesting - 6</td>', 'my eyes are drawn to the green buoy and the ship i''m afraid.......without them this would be interesting - 6', '2007-05-13 08:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643804, 508704, 72103, '<td valign="top">like it somehow.......nice 7</td>', 'like it somehow.......nice 7', '2007-05-13 08:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643807, 507374, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice, it''s all there, balance, action, contrasting and complimenting colours.........  nice 8</td>', 'nice, it''s all there, balance, action, contrasting and complimenting colours.........  nice 8', '2007-05-13 08:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643808, 507822, 72103, '<td valign="top">nice lines...............</td>', 'nice lines...............', '2007-05-13 08:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643810, 509084, 72103, '<td valign="top">being a dog lover i love it....... 8</td>', 'being a dog lover i love it....... 8', '2007-05-13 08:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643811, 508622, 76185, '<td valign="top">Good composition, interesting subject. Shadow on his face with the aggressively green background don''t quite work for me though I''m afraid.</td>', 'Good composition, interesting subject. Shadow on his face with the aggressively green background don''t quite work for me though I''m afraid.', '2007-05-13 08:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3643814, 506669, 76185, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Shame about the distraction in the bottom right corner though :/</td>', 'Great shot. Shame about the distraction in the bottom right corner though :/', '2007-05-13 08:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
