(3645162, 508420, 39144, '<td valign="top">Where is the action? The contrast is very weak in this shot, and you can see many JPEG artifacts as well.</td>', 'Where is the action? The contrast is very weak in this shot, and you can see many JPEG artifacts as well.', '2007-05-13 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645179, 508462, 39144, '<td valign="top">There is too much of a stretch on this one. Aside from that, the brush in the foreground is very distracting, there is a dust spot very visible in the water. I''m sure at some point the hippo turned over. I would have recommended to take it again after that happened. And then work with both the levels and contrast in pp as well.</td>', 'There is too much of a stretch on this one. Aside from that, the brush in the foreground is very distracting, there is a dust spot very visible in the water. I''m sure at some point the hippo turned over. I would have recommended to take it again after that happened. And then work with both the levels and contrast in pp as well.', '2007-05-13 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645182, 508211, 39144, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful landscape shot. I love the colors present throughout the photo. Nice work.</td>', 'What a beautiful landscape shot. I love the colors present throughout the photo. Nice work.', '2007-05-13 23:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645192, 508618, 39144, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot. I really like how low the sun is on the horizon. Nice work.</td>', 'What an awesome shot. I really like how low the sun is on the horizon. Nice work.', '2007-05-14 00:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645200, 508561, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great DOF on this one. Nice job.</td>', 'Great DOF on this one. Nice job.', '2007-05-14 00:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645204, 509520, 39144, '<td valign="top">Oooohhh!!! I love this shot. The sharpness is perfect. The lighting was done just right. The background, the subject, everything! Now, with all of that said, how in the world do you light a shot like this?</td>', 'Oooohhh!!! I love this shot. The sharpness is perfect. The lighting was done just right. The background, the subject, everything! Now, with all of that said, how in the world do you light a shot like this?', '2007-05-14 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
