(3645273, 508058, 66494, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, this shot appeals to a Tiger fan from waaaay back!   I like the texture on this shot, I assume shot thru the netting ... it works, IMO.</td>', 'Ahhh, this shot appeals to a Tiger fan from waaaay back!   I like the texture on this shot, I assume shot thru the netting ... it works, IMO.', '2007-05-14 00:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
