(3645960, 508403, 20956, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF, it makes me feel that I am right there ready to throw the ball. The ball is slightly out of focus.</td>', 'Excellent DOF, it makes me feel that I am right there ready to throw the ball. The ball is slightly out of focus.', '2007-05-14 02:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
