(3645970, 507591, 20956, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of catching the moment. Nice dof.</td>', 'Excellent job of catching the moment. Nice dof.', '2007-05-14 02:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645972, 509518, 20956, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.</td>', 'I don''t get it.', '2007-05-14 02:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645977, 509282, 20956, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but I''m not sure black &amp; white is the best choice. The blacks are not all that black and the whites look washed out. I would like to see the color version of this photo.</td>', 'Nice photo but I''m not sure black & white is the best choice. The blacks are not all that black and the whites look washed out. I would like to see the color version of this photo.', '2007-05-14 02:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645982, 506426, 20956, '<td valign="top">I like how the subject is coming into the photo. The white does look a little washed (pardon the pun) out.</td>', 'I like how the subject is coming into the photo. The white does look a little washed (pardon the pun) out.', '2007-05-14 02:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645990, 509389, 20956, '<td valign="top">Some cropping would help this photo, to much background.</td>', 'Some cropping would help this photo, to much background.', '2007-05-14 02:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645993, 509456, 20956, '<td valign="top">Very nice stop action and depth of field. Cropping would have been nice.</td>', 'Very nice stop action and depth of field. Cropping would have been nice.', '2007-05-14 02:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3645995, 506947, 20956, '<td valign="top">Nice action. Nice crop.</td>', 'Nice action. Nice crop.', '2007-05-14 02:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3646006, 507902, 20956, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of stopping the action. Good focus. Nice crop. The faces are a little dark. But I know that this is a hard shot to get because I have tried to take the same type of photo.</td>', 'Excellent job of stopping the action. Good focus. Nice crop. The faces are a little dark. But I know that this is a hard shot to get because I have tried to take the same type of photo.', '2007-05-14 03:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3646015, 508682, 20956, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, bad conversion to black and white. Your blacks are not black and your whites are gray. Like I told another photo that I rated, I would like to see this one in color.</td>', 'Excellent photo, bad conversion to black and white. Your blacks are not black and your whites are gray. Like I told another photo that I rated, I would like to see this one in color.', '2007-05-14 03:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3646034, 509440, 20956, '<td valign="top">The best one I have seen so far. A 10. I know how much timing it takes to get a photo like this. Good job.</td>', 'The best one I have seen so far. A 10. I know how much timing it takes to get a photo like this. Good job.', '2007-05-14 03:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3646053, 508186, 20956, '<td valign="top">A very good photo. I''ve tried this shot myself and the sky has a tendancy to cause the subject to become so dark that it looks like a silhouette. The only suggestion I could make on this photo is take the photo more from the left or right so you are not so straight on. Also a shot from the front would be nice. Good job.</td>', 'A very good photo. I''ve tried this shot myself and the sky has a tendancy to cause the subject to become so dark that it looks like a silhouette. The only suggestion I could make on this photo is take the photo more from the left or right so you are not so straight on. Also a shot from the front would be nice. Good job.', '2007-05-14 03:16:13.000000', NULL, 1);
