(3646129, 509111, 20956, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shutter speed, very different. A nice touch of blurring the  cyclist. What puts it all in perspective is the writing on the window.</td>', 'Nice use of shutter speed, very different. A nice touch of blurring the  cyclist. What puts it all in perspective is the writing on the window.', '2007-05-14 03:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
