(3646676, 507847, 54634, '<td valign="top">Perfect winner to be, excellent shot, just admiring ur skills and composition. I am so sure u will take a ribbon.</td>', 'Perfect winner to be, excellent shot, just admiring ur skills and composition. I am so sure u will take a ribbon.', '2007-05-14 09:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
