(3651695, 509474, 33164, '<td valign="top">Frustrating having the chain link there.  It''s very distracting.  If you have a long enough lens, go around the other side and get a good head on shot and avoid the chain link.</td>', 'Frustrating having the chain link there.  It''s very distracting.  If you have a long enough lens, go around the other side and get a good head on shot and avoid the chain link.', '2007-05-15 14:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
