(3651733, 508563, 33164, '<td valign="top">interesting choice... can''t decide if I like it.  Very well executed, no doubt.  gives it a very vintage feel.  All right, after looking at it for a while, I''ve decided it was a good choice.  Would be interested in seeing the edit in color though.</td>', 'interesting choice... can''t decide if I like it.  Very well executed, no doubt.  gives it a very vintage feel.  All right, after looking at it for a while, I''ve decided it was a good choice.  Would be interested in seeing the edit in color though.', '2007-05-15 14:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
