(3652636, 507696, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely stop-action.  The horse is gorgeous; the rider looks like she''s concentrating pretty seriously.  The crop leaves room for the horse to land ;-)</td>', 'Lovely stop-action.  The horse is gorgeous; the rider looks like she''s concentrating pretty seriously.  The crop leaves room for the horse to land ;-)', '2007-05-15 19:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
