(3652929, 506212, 3149, '<td valign="top">I''ve been there a few times, and I recall the orange being a little brighter.  Nice use of color.  I would have rated you higher if you titled it "A Cleveland Brown Closeup".  I wish you the best of luck.<br/> <br/>UPDATE:  I was wrong...  I bumped up your score.  Again.  Best of luck!</td>', 'I''ve been there a few times, and I recall the orange being a little brighter.  Nice use of color.  I would have rated you higher if you titled it "A Cleveland Brown Closeup".  I wish you the best of luck. UPDATE:  I was wrong...  I bumped up your score.  Again.  Best of luck!', '2007-05-15 21:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3652935, 507446, 26827, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2007-05-15 21:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
