(3653629, 509408, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but even though is at dusk, is still too dark for my taste. I know there are ways to manipulate the camera in order to bring an early nighttime effect to the shot without losing definition and clarity because of the darkness.<br/> <br/>Otherwise.... great shot. Loved the angle from which you took the shot...wouldn''t have had anywhere near the impact if you had been on level ground or even below the line of sight.<br/> <br/>Great job! I would have given this an 8 but for the darkness I dropped it a point. This decision will haunt me...</td>', 'Nice shot, but even though is at dusk, is still too dark for my taste. I know there are ways to manipulate the camera in order to bring an early nighttime effect to the shot without losing definition and clarity because of the darkness. Otherwise.... great shot. Loved the angle from which you took the shot...wouldn''t have had anywhere near the impact if you had been on level ground or even below the line of sight. Great job! I would have given this an 8 but for the darkness I dropped it a point. This decision will haunt me...', '2007-05-16 00:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
