(3655169, 509474, 30584, '<td valign="top">I just wanna say, thanks for the helpful comments....as for the fence and the rear-facing view...they are additional SUBJECTS of the picture..supposed to depict a mothers view of her child playing, and the fence is part of it, as the mother is behind the fence.  But, thanks for the nice comments anyway.<br/>~~and thank you Melethia, for getting it!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-16 09:15:50.</i></td>', 'I just wanna say, thanks for the helpful comments....as for the fence and the rear-facing view...they are additional SUBJECTS of the picture..supposed to depict a mothers view of her child playing, and the fence is part of it, as the mother is behind the fence.  But, thanks for the nice comments anyway.~~and thank you Melethia, for getting it!', '2007-05-16 10:15:19.000000', '2007-05-16 10:15:50.000000', 0),
