(3655677, 508001, 35545, '<td valign="top">Way cool.  I love the colors and the kites.  Are those little creature bodies?  I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/811.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=811" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Karmat</a> that putting this on the diagonal might help, but, personally, I''m fine with things the way they are.<br/> <br/>P.S.  Kite racing????  I''ve just learned something.  I''ll have to watch the sports page for local events.  8)</td>', 'Way cool.  I love the colors and the kites.  Are those little creature bodies?  I agree with  Karmat that putting this on the diagonal might help, but, personally, I''m fine with things the way they are. P.S.  Kite racing????  I''ve just learned something.  I''ll have to watch the sports page for local events.  8)', '2007-05-16 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
