(3656866, 507847, 77425, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for the comments and votes!<br/> <br/>This is a place that we fish regularly, so I knew I''d get the chance get a great image like this. I''d like to thank mother nature for cooperating. :-D (so much more of this is natural beauty than ability) And to break a few hearts, yes, it was staged. I had Aalden pump and reel (no fish) a few times while i took several shots.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for the comments and votes! This is a place that we fish regularly, so I knew I''d get the chance get a great image like this. I''d like to thank mother nature for cooperating. :-D (so much more of this is natural beauty than ability) And to break a few hearts, yes, it was staged. I had Aalden pump and reel (no fish) a few times while i took several shots.', '2007-05-16 17:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3656900, 509517, 3032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LanndonKane:</b></div><hr/><i> the fish looks fake. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah I agree. It is probably one of those singing fish that Sher got from TellSell TV. They can even waggle their tails. :))))<br/> <br/>:P<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by LanndonKane: the fish looks fake.   Yeah I agree. It is probably one of those singing fish that Sher got from TellSell TV. They can even waggle their tails. :)))) :P ', '2007-05-16 17:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
