(3657172, 509307, 42792, '<td valign="top">Great to hit a PB again!  Thanks for all the votes and comments!  The shot was taken at full zoom from above the <a href="//www.thermalmonster.com/dunes1.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Great Dune of Pyla</a>(highest dune in Europe).  This image was the best aerial view I found from the web depicting exactly the extent of this wondrous natural formation. THat''s why it felt like I was in the air as well.  The place was a great find and it''s a haven for parasailing and paragliding. :)<br/> <br/>My alternative choice (below) for this challenge had brighter colour pop but I thought my actual entry reflected more the spirit of a sport in action.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=509314" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509314.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509314.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509314.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Other outtakes:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=509311" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509311.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509311.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509311.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=509309" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509309.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509309.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509309.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=509308" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509308.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509308.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/42792/thumb/509308.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Great to hit a PB again!  Thanks for all the votes and comments!  The shot was taken at full zoom from above the Great Dune of Pyla(highest dune in Europe).  This image was the best aerial view I found from the web depicting exactly the extent of this wondrous natural formation. THat''s why it felt like I was in the air as well.  The place was a great find and it''s a haven for parasailing and paragliding. :) My alternative choice (below) for this challenge had brighter colour pop but I thought my actual entry reflected more the spirit of a sport in action.  Other outtakes:  ', '2007-05-16 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3657206, 509471, 42792, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Congratulations for an almost PB too! :)  I caught this while browsing thru and thought it was one of the best action shots taken.  The hidden face doesn''t bother me at all and I love how the water sprays turned out - so much drama capture.  My only tiny nitpick is the very high contrast that makes the whites look over-exposed.  But, it''s a minor detail seeing how this is basic editing and I understand how tough it can get for such a shot - Kudos Mark!</td>', 'Wow!!! Congratulations for an almost PB too! :)  I caught this while browsing thru and thought it was one of the best action shots taken.  The hidden face doesn''t bother me at all and I love how the water sprays turned out - so much drama capture.  My only tiny nitpick is the very high contrast that makes the whites look over-exposed.  But, it''s a minor detail seeing how this is basic editing and I understand how tough it can get for such a shot - Kudos Mark!', '2007-05-16 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3657241, 508032, 42792, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, no surprise here. Knew I had it tough coming when I saw this shot during browsing.  congratulations Doc! ... must be the magic of 5D ... ;)</td>', 'Mmmm, no surprise here. Knew I had it tough coming when I saw this shot during browsing.  congratulations Doc! ... must be the magic of 5D ... ;)', '2007-05-16 18:55:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3657251, 508462, 62009, '<td valign="top"><b>Greets from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>As you''ve gotten from a lot of the previous commenters, this doesn''t seem to relate to sports for the majority of people.  Without the title, it wouldn''t fit at all.  <br/> <br/>While a fatastic capture, the photo is a bit boring.  The majority of the photo is made up of shades of brown.  It also seems to me that the focus is on some of the weeds in the front, rather on the hippo''s feet.<br/> <br/>If this was helpful, please make sure to click the helpful box.  If you have any questions or comments, feel free to PM me.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.<br/> <br/>--Mike</td>', 'Greets from the Critique Club  As you''ve gotten from a lot of the previous commenters, this doesn''t seem to relate to sports for the majority of people.  Without the title, it wouldn''t fit at all.   While a fatastic capture, the photo is a bit boring.  The majority of the photo is made up of shades of brown.  It also seems to me that the focus is on some of the weeds in the front, rather on the hippo''s feet. If this was helpful, please make sure to click the helpful box.  If you have any questions or comments, feel free to PM me. Keep shooting. --Mike', '2007-05-16 18:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
