(3657465, 509517, 1717, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Azrifel:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LanndonKane:</b></div><hr/><i> the fish looks fake. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah I agree. It is probably one of those singing fish that Sher got from TellSell TV. They can even waggle their tails. :))))<br/> <br/>:P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>oh pffft!  don''t think i won''t kick your ass for a comment like that! :P<br/> <br/>xoxo</td>', 'Originally posted by Azrifel: Originally posted by LanndonKane: the fish looks fake.   Yeah I agree. It is probably one of those singing fish that Sher got from TellSell TV. They can even waggle their tails. :)))) :P   oh pffft!  don''t think i won''t kick your ass for a comment like that! :P xoxo', '2007-05-16 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
