(3659421, 508211, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by crayon:</b></div><hr/><i> wow look at that, what a nice photo!<br/>the water and clouds are amazing.<br/> <br/>edit: this is my 1000th comment :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey...I feel privileged...thankyou!!</td>', 'Originally posted by crayon: wow look at that, what a nice photo!the water and clouds are amazing. edit: this is my 1000th comment :)   Hey...I feel privileged...thankyou!!', '2007-05-17 09:12:57.000000', NULL, 0),
