(3661534, 509307, 35545, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful feeling of being suspended in the air.  "Pop" and "wow" have their place, but in this shot they are totally unnecessary, and, IMNSHO, would be intrusive and counter-productive.</td>', 'What a wonderful feeling of being suspended in the air.  "Pop" and "wow" have their place, but in this shot they are totally unnecessary, and, IMNSHO, would be intrusive and counter-productive.', '2007-05-17 21:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
