(3670858, 507374, 22734, '<td valign="top">A powerful image because often we place ourselves at the hands of fate where many endeavors invite our participation...Ah...only when we get there and do it and then realize that we knew about the possible dangers, but now, like in this image, the participant in "in the eye of the experience". An outstanding capture and a very good entry for this challenge. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'A powerful image because often we place ourselves at the hands of fate where many endeavors invite our participation...Ah...only when we get there and do it and then realize that we knew about the possible dangers, but now, like in this image, the participant in "in the eye of the experience". An outstanding capture and a very good entry for this challenge. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2007-05-20 22:31:06.000000', NULL, 0),
