(3675155, 508704, 67145, '<td valign="top">wow .. this is a fantastic shot ... i really dont agree with the ppl who say it looks unnatural .. if its a basic edit, then it cant be!!!!!!! .. idiots!! ... great action shot ... so sharp  .. love the composition and the lines of his arms in relation to the ball ... excellent .. :)</td>', 'wow .. this is a fantastic shot ... i really dont agree with the ppl who say it looks unnatural .. if its a basic edit, then it cant be!!!!!!! .. idiots!! ... great action shot ... so sharp  .. love the composition and the lines of his arms in relation to the ball ... excellent .. :)', '2007-05-21 15:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
