(4275649, 509389, 47906, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really nice shot, I like the angle that the boys body is at, and I like the greens in the photo they are nicely saturated. Colorful and details are good.<br/> <br/>JIMO, I think if you had cropped off some of the foreground grass so he was standing on the bottom third it would be a bit stronger than the centered composition here. <br/> <br/>In the challenge I gave this a 6.</td>', 'I think this is a really nice shot, I like the angle that the boys body is at, and I like the greens in the photo they are nicely saturated. Colorful and details are good. JIMO, I think if you had cropped off some of the foreground grass so he was standing on the bottom third it would be a bit stronger than the centered composition here.  In the challenge I gave this a 6.', '2007-11-29 07:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
